<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Onobasulu (ONN) - Anne Dondorp September 14, 2001</book>
  <para style="h">Maga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Awalu Sulu Nafulu Magahe Selelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Awalu Sulu Nafulu</para>
  <para style="mt">Magahe Selelu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu helefealu iwi ligia, kegele E mololu amone, awalu sulu nafulu selelu dobu amone, bugo biniba aleba ami, maugaba seleba ufulumo, bugo Maga ewe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bugo ewehe ninifea eweguba walefe. Inolo Yesu E-mo, dabalu nokene nokeneba moloyone wida solu kiwida labe. Yesuhe idele inolofea walesiada, gamodo asigasiada, idele inolone wolu heesia galisiada, amone awalu alegasia, ninihe Ene kiwigagaluda, Ene wi wabialeloda, ami bosolu. Yesuhe Ene meleba saaba sulu selesiamo, E Inololene Faibeba solu. Aufia, E selesia, E mulumo, idele inolo sagoba ofelesia, ene miliyolu weasesia, idele inolo wedinale amone gasiba dafelagosia, su meyone muluba solu. (Maga 10.45 ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Maugaba Magahe awasiamo, Hano Gelo Yonene dabaluda, Yesu hano gelumoda, henanehe Yesu dedeba abulumoda, amone awaba selelu. Aufia, Magahe awasia, dufia Yesuhe inolo higiniluda sebumofea kanulusia waaleluba selelu. Maugabamo, Yesune walelu faibili ilihe E mololumone mau fadaba asigilualeso, dufia ilihe esebalo esebaloba Efea dawalolo dulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nini bugo ewe alegasia bisigiamo, inolo noolo Yesune gisa holobagasia, ilihe Efea higinilu wedinale melu bosolu. Aufia, Magahe awalu sulu ewene afelesia, Yesu olafia haiba degelumone awalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yonehe Yesu milesine eno felaba madenelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Madiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-9">Lugu 3.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yone 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char>, Godene Faibe amo, Ene Awalu Sulu Nafulu eweguba selesia maugafe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>Godene Bugo usu <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 1:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="qt">“Bama. Nahe Ne sulu saaba sigimesi dia ano inolomo Ga saminiba malesi hilibaiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="qt">Edale abia, Ga malesi, eno felaba madeneyobafe.</char><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ais 40.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Isale hele falaiya ami, inolo uleno mofeyo eweguba wuaaba selaba miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="qt">‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char> E milesine-eee,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="qt">eno isoba felaba madenema-aaa!’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:24">HD 13.24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:4">19.4</ref></char>
    </note>Auba saaba ufulugulu, inolo uleno, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char>, holobagafia, isale hele falaiya ami ligia, idele inolo amofea waleba alolu. Sulu mana walesiamo, ehe idele inolofea selesia, “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisi</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gesenaga</char>, Godehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyobafeba</char>” solu. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Idele inolo sunia hele Yudiafiada, Yelusalamefiada, Yone e selefe dubiyoneda, molofe babiyoneda, milibaifia gagaiyolu. Ine wolu fogaba selesi, Yonehe ili hano Yodene geba waalelu.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Kin 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:8">Mad 11.8</ref></char>
    </note>Yonehe dofene <char style="w" lemma="Kamele">kamelene</char> alumo fagulogulu moloba kaafia, madibuda amone bado ofolo. Ene naiyomo, galiawadai, age hanodai, amosu naba ado. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:25">HD 13.25</ref></char></note>E eweguba saaba meba alolu. “Inolo uleno dufia na faisa miyobafemo, Ene kiwigagalumohe ne kiwigagalumo suniaba wasolu. Na Edai lilibuale. Na-mo, Ene dabalu moloba ofolo miliyone imini loluale. Aulugulu, na wida male koleba ligia, na emo hugulumo sagafia, Ene samaga husia efolo fisigaeyone lililuale lolu. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nahe gili hano balu geba waalesu. Auluso, inolo amo Ehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemo</char> geba waaleyobafe.” Yone auba solu.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Yesu hano geba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Madiyu 3.13–4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lugu 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Auba moloba labi, Yesu E Nasalede dauno hele Galili amifia goasi, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> E hano Yodene geba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu E hano ulubaifia holobagaba lagosi, bosolufalumo, alebale hamagi, <char style="w">hebene</char> sogoba ofelesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> haga maliabugulu, huga inigia, E saabia yoba aselesi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ais 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mad 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mag 9.7</ref></char></note>Hebenefia sulu goo uleno eweguba sabaisi dubulu. “Ga ne Naalo, Ne yaguso amo, Ga koleba! Na Gafea bule koleba henesu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus Baptized" file="41_Mk_01_07_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="1.9-11">Yonehe Yesu hano geba ofasia labi, maliabu suga saabe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henanehe Yesu dedeba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Madiyu 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lugu 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Aufasia, alebale koleba <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanehe</char>, Yesumo isale hele falaiya ami lubia daalu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-13">Sng 91.11-13</ref></char></note>Ausi, E hele falaiya ami, hilia daabuluba biniba ilo kelebulu aleba ami labi, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenehe</char> E wolu molomesine dedeba abulu. Ausi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ilihe E uluba alolu.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Galili ami dabalu maugalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Madiyu 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lugu 5.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:35-42">Yone 1.35-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mag 6.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> sefasia dibolo dafogofia labi, Yesu E Galili helea obegeba daafia, Godene Awalu Sulu nafulu saaba meyo daalu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mad 3.2</ref></char></note>E selesia, “Hilia Gode iminilumo holobagabu. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labe. Wolufealo faiso mefia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimale</char>. Godene awalu sulu nafulufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homaleba</char> solu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo biniba wesi, ili E kuliba daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Madiyu 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lugu 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Hilia uleno Yesu E Galili waiyo galubu amone egewi daaba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonodai</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduludai</char>, hani selege dafogoba labi abulu. Aalu waiyo galulu ami hani sigiba molabasu ado. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesuhe aalu bisigia, aalufea weba selesia, “Aalihe hani sigiloguba, idele inoloda sigiba molamesine, Nahe aali moloba waleyoba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Auba selesi, aalu alebale aine alu selege gadefia, E kuliba maiyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Wedino egewi amo aleba asogofia, Yesu Ehe Sebedine faibe, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, hano kasu saabia yoba sigia, alu selege asogoba labi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />E wesi, aalu alebale aine enaomo, dabalu mololo noolodai, hano kasu saabia waagi melasia, gadefia, E kuliba maiyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo ulefea asubane wolu asigalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lugu 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ili amo abia, Kafanima dauno goalu. <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> adesi, Yuda ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> sugafia, Yesu E ami ligia, Godene sulu mana idele inolofea walelu. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mad 7.28-29</ref></char></note>Sulu E selefemo, momoleba dobelesia, ili hidigilu. Mau enebamo, E walesiamo, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> walelogubale. Aubale. Inolo wida solu kiwida dawalolo inolo waleloguba walelu. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23-24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:7">Mag 5.7</ref></char></note>Yesu E waleba labi, inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane woluda</char> alolumo gulugululo moloa ami, alebale koleba galagiliba selesia, “Nasalede Yesu-ooo, Ga ninifea eneba moloyone mulu? Ga nini woba ofelesia, dufa dafaliyone mulubile? Na hilisesia, Ga inolo amobuba fadaba bosolu. <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">Muuba Kalilu Noekene</char> Inolo Godefea alefasia mulumo, amo Ga-bu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe asubane wolufea halaleba selesia, “Ga sauma! Inolo ogo gadefia afa mala!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:26">Mag 9.26</ref></char></note>Ausi, asubane woluhe e dufa gauwasi, yadosia sogaaba gaafia, e gadefia afa daalu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Idele inolo suniahe molofe amo baafia, momoleba hidigifia, ine geleba nenesiamo selesia, “Aga mololumo, ene mololubi? Wae! Inolo ewe sulu hili nokene walefe. E walesiamo, inolo wida sodo dawalolo inolo waleloguba walefe. E malaba selesi, asubane woluda Ene sulu dobolobu.” Idele inolo auba neneba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mad 4.24</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu E mololu sadalu, alebale Galili hele sunia sulu gi doba sigilu.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Saimonone enamolo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Madiyu 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lugu 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">Gulugululo molo</char> afasia, Yesuda ili alebale <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonodai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduludai</char>, aine moloa daalu. <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]] Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, aaluda, ili galiba daalu. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Moloa ami, Saimonone enamolo idomo, domala haloba walefasi, molobia ami hanefia alolu. Ili alebale Yesufea e walefa dobuba saaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ausi, idoda hanefia labea daafia, Yesuhe e gasiba ifolu. Gasiba ifosi, walefa halo waisia gelesi, ehe ine naiyo madenelu.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Madiyu 8.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Lugu 4.40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Hilia hamagayamo, geide halo uluba sesi, ili walefaluda, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> adaaba yaaluda, Yesu labea uluba dibia milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Mosomu idele inolo amo sunia milibaifia, ili molo Eda saabea ami, eno saliba aniba ami gagaiyolu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:10-12">Mag 3.10-12</ref></char></note>Auba gagaiyosi, Yesuhe idele inolo walefa nonoba waalelumo, saludiale waiba waalelu. Ehe gamodo wedinale idele inolofea adaaba yaalumo asigaba dafalilu. Gamodo ilihe E amobuba baaba goleluso, Yesuhe ilifea auba samabusia, saumaba gadiba solu.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Galili ami Godene sulu mana selabia siba alolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lugu 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:23">Mad 14.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:46">Mag 6.46</ref></char>
    </note>Keafa nigilibale koleba, Yesu E degefasia, inoloda maleiya heeba duluiya ami daafia, Godedai sulu solu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonoda</char>, ene damene nooloda, Yesu fuduba isaeyo dedalelu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ilihe E baaba golefia, Efea eweguba solu. “Suniahe Ga isafe”. <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Auba selesi, E ilifea selesia, “Waagima. Nini mosomu noolo aniba dobu amida, waleba saeyo maiyoba. Mau amone Na mulu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mad 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9.35</ref></char></note>Aufia, E hele Galili ami siba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> sunia sulu mana waleba selabia sisiamo, <char style="w">gamodo</char> inolofea adaaba yaalumoda asigaba dafalilu.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe yolida alolu inolo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:2-4">Madiyu 8.2-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-14">Lugu 5.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Aiye yolida aseba samodolu inolo uleno Yesu labea milifasia, emo hugulumo sagafia, susiba selesia, “Saminilo, Ga koleba, na galagololu melesi hamesenaga, amo Ga na waiba ufiyodolubu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe inolo amofea bule yagunagafia, Ene sone isosia, e gesia selesia, “Na auba hamefe. Ga waisia galagololu mela!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ausi, alebale hamagi, aiye yoli amo asigilesi, inolo amo galagololu holobagalu. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ausi, Yesuhe inolo amo alebale malasia, efea sulu kolelu eweguba solu. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Wkp 14.1-32</ref></char></note>“Kegele gafea mololu ogomo, inolo ulenofea samabiyo. Aubale. Auluso, inolo noolohe ga seale wailububa asigimesine, ga abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inolofea</char> gene waleyo dafasia, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> samini molomaleba soluguba, ga ulu kegele soba meyone mala.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Auluso, inolo amo dafasia, idele inolo noolofea selesia, Yesu efea auba mololuba selabasu labi, hele sunia doba sigilu. Auba ausi, Yesu E mosomu ami, idele inolo si saabia maiyodoluale baafia, egesia inoloda maleiya ami labi, idele inolo nolobalo nolobalofia E labea milibailu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe kakaloba dulu inolo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:2-8">Madiyu 9.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:18-26">Lugu 5.18-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Hilia noolo samodofasia, Yesu E Kafanima obegeba daafia, E moloa mulu labeba solumo doba sigilu. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Aufia, idele inolo wedinale E labea gagaiyosia, molo usuda, eno saliba anibada, fogo male dedelefia labi, Yesu E Godene sulu mana waleba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Auba labi, inolo biniba noolohe kakaloba dulu inolo uleno dafu adolu saabia ofasia, Yesu labea ikauba dibia mulu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Auluso, fogo dedelelune, ilihe inolomo Yesu labea dia sugaeyodoluale baafia, molo fagia dibia felalu. Aufia, Yesuda labe iminiba ami, molo fagilu olabofia, eno ofelesi, inolo dafu adolumo efolo godaifia, molo usu fisigaba dafa ilogolu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> baafia, Yesuhe kakalolu inolofea selesia, “Faibe, ge <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galife</char>.” <figure style="fig" alt="Paralyzed man, hole in roof" file="41_Mk_02_06_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="2.1-12">Yesuhe kakaloba dulu inolo waiba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Auba selesi, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> noolo moloa ami kakainalumo, ine geleba hilisesia, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Inolo ogo, sulu amoguba selefe ogo, enebane ause? E auba selefe ogo, ‘Na Godegulu loluba’ selefe. Auba selefemo, Ehe samabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe. Inolo uleno wolu hamasia heesia galilale. Wolu hamasia heesia galilomo, Gode E-su labe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Auba hilisesi, Yesuhe alebale ine libo auba hilisefemo baaba golesia, E ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Gine asigi ogo, enesi auba hiliseba yaase? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kakaloba dulufea saeyomo sulu abeelu halabu? ‘Ge wolu hamasia heesia galisuba’ saeyo amobula, me ‘Degefia abia, dafu dia malaba’ saeyo amobula? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Auluso, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo, helefealu iwi wolu hamasia heesia galiyone wida solu kiwigagalu labe. Aulugulu, gili auba fadaba asigimesine, Nahe kakaloba dulu ewefea eweguba saeyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />Aufia, Ehe kakalolu inolo amofea selesia, “Ga, degema! Ge dafu adolu difasia, gene moloa mala.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Auba selesi, inolo amo alebale degefasia, idele inolo sunia si saabia ene dafu asulu difasia daalu. Ausi, ili sunia momoleba bisigia, Godene wi wabialesia selesia, “Wae! Kegele amogulu koleba bolale bosoluba” solu.<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Lifai welu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Madiyu 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lugu 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu molo gadefia, waiyo galubu amone egewi saabia daaba labi, idele inolo fuluba E labea milibaifia, amaleba galisi, Ehe sulu mana ilifea walelu. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />E daaba ligia bisigia, inolo uleno dagese mole diaba ada moloa ami yoba saabi abulu. Inolo amo Alufiusune faibe, ene wimo <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Lifai</char>. Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga Na kuliba mila.” Auba selesi, Lifai degefasia, E kuliba daalu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Aufia, Yesuhe Lifaine moloa yoba sigia, naiyo naba labi, dagese dilo inoloda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inoloda, wedinale milibaifia, Yesuda Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ili galiba ua naiyo naba kakainalu. Inolo amogulu wedinalehe Yesu kuliba sibaisalo. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:19">Mad 11.19</ref></char></note>Yesu E mole dilo inoloda, wolu mololo inoloda, ilidai naiyo naba saabi, <char style="w">Falisi</char><char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">inolo manada asigilu</char> abulu. Auba baafia, ilihe Yesune walelu faibilifea doba bisigia, “Ehe mole diloda, wolu mololoda, ilidai ua naiyo naafego. Enesi aufe?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Auba selesi dofasia, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Dogodahe domala nafulu fisigalu labemofea dabalu mololale. Aubale. Dogodahe walefa inolo ilifeasu dabalu moloba ado. Aubasu, Na mulumo, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> inolo weyone muluale. Aubale. Na mulumo, wolu mololo idele inolo weyone mulu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesufea naiyo aiyayone mana amone doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-14">Madiyu 12.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lugu 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Hilia uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisine</char> walelu faibilida, ili Gode hilisesia naiyo sunia aiyasia, nabale labi bafasia, inolo noolo Yesu labea milifasia, eweguba doba abulu. “Yone ene walelu faibilida, Falisine walelu faibilida, ili Gode hilisesia <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyafegulu</char>, no, Ga walelu faibili aiyafalego, enebane aufe?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea besi sulu eweguba solu. “Ido ifosia, inolone damenedalida, idone damenedalida gagaiyofea amimo, ili naiyo aiyalola? Aa. Idoda diyo inolo aso ili galiba ua yoba saabimo, ili naiyo aiyalale. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Auluso, dufia, idoda diyomo uluba dibia daafia labi, fogo ami, ene damenedalimo naiyo ami aiyayobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besi sulu ewemo, </char><char style="fq">idoda diyo</char> inolomo, Yesu iminife.</note><verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu no eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe fagulo kaide bidilu amofea asogoyo hilisesenaga, amo e fagulo hagaea haisi gelelu difasia, kaide bidilu amofea asogolale. Aubale. Auba asogosiabiaga, fagulo amo hano heesi, hagaeamo sigisia, kaidelumo bule gagalabaiyo. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Inolo ulenohe <char style="w">waini</char> sebe dedelefia, waini hano hili mololu amo, dofene meme bado asogolu agogolelumofea hogonialale. Aubale. Auba hogoniasiabiaga, amo waini hano hilimo, hoo kaaba galusia, dofene meme bado agogolelumo fisigasia, waini hanomo hele saabia sagaba dabaiyo. Ausimo, kelebulu bado hamagada, bidiba dafaiyo. Aulune, waini sebe hano hilimo, kelebulu bado hagaea hili asogolumofea hogonialo. Ausi, kegele aida amo aalifaba nafulu ufia ado.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe halemane ado hilia dabalu mololale amone mana solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Madiyu 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lugu 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> uleno, Yesuda ili desi widi gelu aleba dedaleba ligia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> <char style="w" lemma="Widi">desi widi sebe</char> noolo suba nalabia, dedaleba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Lo 23.25</ref></char></note>Auba molofe bafasia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo noolo Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Doma. Godene mugulihe Sabada hilia elo ofelesia, mana ewe molomabiyoba solugulu, ili auba molofe ogo, enesi aufe?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sml 21.1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba doba besabi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Amakele <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidida</char>, e galiba sibaisaloda, ili amo mamiasi, kegele mololumone sadalu amo, gili alegalualela? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Wkp 24.5-9</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, Abiada e <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> labi, Deibidi e Godene molo usu sugafia, <char style="w">boledi</char> Godene olegia diba ufia adomo, e difasia, nabia, noolomo e galiba sibaisalo amofeada namenesi melu. Boledi amo <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilisu namenesi, inolo baluhe namenabiyoba muguli ufulu. Aulugulu, Deibidi auba naasihe muguli molomabiyolu gelelu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Lo 5.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Aulugulu, Gode Ehe halemane ado hilia amo mololumo, idele inolo ilihe hilia amofea sagoba homesine mololuale. Aubale. Godehe halemane ado hilia mololumo, amohe idele inolofea sagoba homesine mololu. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Aulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibehe</char> Sabada hilia amone yasilo labe. Aulugulu, hilia amimo molomabada, molomabiyobada saeyomo, yasilo ene dabalu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Sabada hilia amohe inolo sone gagilu uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Madiyu 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lugu 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Aufia, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> suga daafia, inolo sone gagilu ami yoba saabi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Auba ausi, ili noolohe Yesu <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> amomo inolo amo waiba ufiyobafelaba babiyone yasifia alolu. Auba molosenaga, amo E sefia egedidifia godoyone daiyafia alolu. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Aufia labi, Yesuhe sone gagilu inolomofea selesia, “Ga degefia, idele inolone si saabia, dogolea iwi yoba miliyo milaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:3">Lug 14.3</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Sulu muguli saaba ufulu sealego hala? Sabada hilia amimo, mana wolu molomalelubile, me mana nafulu molomalelubile? Miliyolu dufa dafiyomobile, me <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyomobula</char>?” Yesu auba selesi, ili sulu sausagafia alolu.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu E ili bebelesia, ine asigi kolelu dobumo baafia, keleba hilisefia gadifasia, inolo sone gagilumofea selesia, “Ga sone isomaba” selesi, ene sone isosi, ene sonemo haiba nafuluba momoloba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:15-16">Mad 22.15-16</ref></char></note>Auba molofe baafia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo alebale degefia, molo gadefia dedalefia, Helodofealo ado inolo noolodai, Yesu dufiyomone daiyayone neneyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waiyo galubu egewi idele inolo wamili gagaiyolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:15-16">Madiyu 12.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lugu 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilida, abia, Galili waiyo galulu dobia ami daalu. Auba aasi, idele inolo wamilimo E kuliba dedaleba ado. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Idele inolo hele Galilifiada, Yudiafiada, Yelusalamefiada, hele Idumeafiada, hano Yodene segeba nolobalofiada, Daila helefealofiada, Saidono helefealofiada, ili Yesu E molofeba solumo dofasia, fuluba E labea milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ausi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Wamili ili amo dedelesia, Na hano kaniba dafogolosi, Na aleba lagoyone hano kasu uleno aniba ufiyo mila.” <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:36">Mad 14.36</ref></char></note>E auba solu maumo, Yesuhe idele inolo wedinale waiba waalefemo baafia, walefada alebailu ili sunia hilisesia, Ehe ilida waiba homesine ili E gebaiyesia, dedeleba abia, E kanilabia daalu. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:41">Lug 4.41</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane woluda</char> alolu inolo ilimo, E bisigia sigibaisasia, sogaasia selesia, “Ga Godene faibeba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:34">Mag 1.34</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea E amobuba samabusia, saumaba halaleba solu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili huguluba molobebelelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Madiyu 10.2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:25-29">12.25-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Lugu 6.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:17-22">11.17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Aufia, Yesu E hele galea felafia, Ene asigiluguba inolo noolo wesi, ili E labea milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14-15" />Aufia, Ehe inolo hugulubamo Edai miliyone molobebelelu. Aufia, ilifea <char style="w">gamodo</char> asigaba dafiyone wida solu kiwida mesia, sulu mana waleyo malesi gadefalu. <verse eid="MRK 3:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:42">Yon 1.42</ref></char></note>Huguluba E molobebelelumo, ine wimo ewe. <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, Yesuhe ene wi no <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidaba</char> ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:54">Lug 9.54</ref></char></note>Aufia, Sebedine faibe <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>. Yesuhe aine wi no <char style="sls">Boanegese</char>ba ufulu. Amone sisamo, “hagana gudulo faibe”. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduluda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Badolomiyu">Badolomiyuda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Madiyuda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domaseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[2]], Alufiusune faibe">Yemese, Alufiusune faibeda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Dadisu">Dadisuda</char>. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Selodo mosomu">Selodo mosomune</char> faibe <char style="w" lemma="Saimono Selodo mosomune faibe">Saimono</char> eda. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodo</char>, dufia e Yesuda holonolumo inolo amo eda.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ili selesia, Yesu E gamodone yasilo amone kiwi alefasia dabalu molofebuba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:24-32">Madiyu 12.24-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lugu 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Aufasia, ili moloa goasi, idele inolo saabia fuluba E labea gagaiyosi, Eda, Ene walelu faibilida, naiyo naiyo fogo male alolu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Yesune damene ilihe, E auba molofeba solu amo dofasia, ili E kagoafebusia, ulubia maiyone mulu.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mad 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inolo noolo Yelusalamefia milibaifasia, selesia, “<char style="w">Besebulu</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamodone</char> yasilo, Efea labebu. Amone kiwi alefasia, E gamodo asigaloba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ili wesia, E labea milibaimalu. Aufia, Ehe ilifea besi sulu eweguba selesia, “<char style="w">Sedene</char> alefasia, henane eneba asigaeyobi? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Yasiba ado uleno, ine meleba aidaba osolafia, yobosenaga, ili amo kiwigaafia kaalu gaeyobafale. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Mosomu uleno, ine meleba aidaba osolafia, yobosenaga, mosomu amo kiwi gaabaiyale. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Aufia, Sedene mosomuhe ine geleba osolafia yobosiabiaga, amoda e kiwi gaabaiyale.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Aufia, Yesu besi sulu no eweguba solu. “Doma. Inolo ulenohe, inolo kiwidane molo usu ami suga daafia, molo biso amo dofabale, ene kegelemo fa diyodoluale miliyobafe. Aubale. Ehe molo biso kiwida amodale efolo dofafasia, moloa kegele dobumo ami fa dilo.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Na seale koleba gilifea eweguba selesu. <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Wolu</char> suniada, gaidaboba soaneba sulu solu sunia amoda, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyobafe</char>. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Auluso, inolo abehe <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amofea saaba gaidabosia, soaneba selesenaga, Godehe ene wolu amo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyobafale</char>. Wolu amomo, ufiasu ilidai alefalu miliyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesuhe sulu eweguba solumone mau ewe. Ilihe Efea <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> labeba solu amo alefasia, Ehe ilifea auba solu.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune seale damenedali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Madiyu 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lugu 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mag 6.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:12">Yon 2.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:14">HD 1.14</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selaba labi, Ene enaeda, Ene elewodalida, ili milibaifasia baea ligia, inolo ulenofea E milamalelu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ausi, idele inolo sogolugaba E amaleba yoba kakainalumo ili Efea selesia, “Ge gaeda, Ge ganodalida, gelewodalida, baea ligia, Ga milafe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Auba selesi, E ilifea sulu obegeba selesia, “Ne nae ogo abe? Ne nelewodalimo, ogo abe?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Aufia, Ehe idele inolo E amaleba kakainabumo bebeleba ligia, selesia, “Bama. Ne naeda, Ne nelewodalida, amo saabe ewe. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Enebamo, Godene hame kuliba aafe ili amomo, Ne nelewodalida, Ne nanodalida, Ne naeda, labe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe widi sebe fifilumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Madiyu 13.1-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Lugu 8.4-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 3:7-9">Mag 3.7-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lug 5.1-3</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, Yesuhe waiyo galubumone egewi ligia, Godene sulu mana saabia waleyo maugalu. Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinale E labea milibaifia, gagaiyoba E amaleba galisi, E hano kasu uleno saabia aleba lagofia, yoba aselesi, idele inolo sunia saii saabia yoba alebailu. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:34">Mad 13.34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mag 4.33-34</ref></char></note> Ili auba alebaibi, Yesuhe besi sulu wedinale ilifea waleba selesia, eweguba solu.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Doma. Inolo uleno geiya widi sebe fifiyosia daalu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />E fifilabia aasi, sebe noolo eno kia hodobaisasi, haga milibaifasia diba mololu. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5-6" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo, hele abane feaba dobia ami hodobaisalu. Hele amo gafinilualegulu, widi sebe amo alebale soboba yaalu. Auluso, halo holobagafia neesimo, widi amo seme sugalualene, sasefia bausosia olalu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo didigane aleba hodobaisalu. Didiganedai, wididai, aalifaba sobosia, didiganehe widimo mabulabia felaba yaalu. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Auluso, widi sebe noolo hele nafuluiya fifilumo, bule sobofasia, sebe helesia, noolomo daabulubasu osoloa helesi, noolomo daabulubasu kaabeba helesi, noolomo daabulubasu daabuluba helelu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus teaches from boat" file="BA03019.tif" size="col" copy="(SIL) used with permission of Louise Bass." ref="4.1-9">Yesu E hano kasu saabia yoba sigia, Godene sulu mana walefe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Inolo sulu dubiyone konenida ga, doma!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E besi sulu solumo, E mau ene asigifia solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Madiyu 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lugu 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Aufasia, Yesu E elebi labi, Ene walelu faibilida, noolo E galiba adomoda, ili milifasia, besi sulu solumone maumo doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Doba besabi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone sulu mau mugusilu ufulu amo, gilifea fadaba walesu. Auluso, idele inolo baea alebaibu ili amofea besi sulusu selesu. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ais 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">HD 28.26-27</ref></char></note>Aulugulu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 4:12" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">ilihe beabasu miliyobafeso, kegele uleno babiyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">Ili dobolabasu miliyobafeso, mau asigiba diyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">Ausiabiaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">ili Godefealo obegeba miyone nolosiabiaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">Ehe ine wolu <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galibaiyo</char>.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Desi widine besi sulu solumone mau ewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Madiyu 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lugu 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Gili besi sulu ewe fadaba disalenaga, Na besi sulu nooloda selesimo, gilihe eneba fadaba asigiba diyobase? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Inolo edo geiya sebe fifilu amogubamo, e Godene sulu fifilo. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Sebe eno kia hodobaisalu amogulumo, idele inolo sulu dobelefeso, <char style="w">Sedene</char> alebale inigia, sulu amo ine ilibo gelumo dibia ano. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Idele inolo noolomo, widi sebe hele abaneda feabia ami hodobaisalu amogulu labe. Ili sulu dobelesiamo, alebale heneba sigiba dobolo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Auluso, seme daalualene, ili fogo wedino koleba ado. Enebamo, ilihe Godene sulu sigiba dubulu amofea alefasia higinilu disenaga, me inolo noolo anogohe ilifea woba ofelesenaga, ine asigi ule ufulumo alebale gelebailo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18-19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:23-24">Mad 19.23-24</ref></char></note>Idele inolo noolomo, widi sebe didigane aleba hodobaisalu amogulu labe. Ilida sulu doboloso, helefealune kegele keleba asigiloda, elebeda ufulu alebaiyeba hame degeloda, kegele nokene nokene hamebaiyesia mesegeloda, mana amohe Godene sulu mana mabulabia felasi, ili sebe helelale. <verse eid="MRK 4:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Auluso, idele inolo noolomo, widi sebe hele nafuluiya hodobaisalu amogulu labe. Ili sulu sigiba dofasia, fedoba sefe amo, sebe helelelo. Noolomo sebe daabulubasu osoloa helesi, noolomo daabulubasu kaabeba helesi, noolomo daabulubasu daabuluba helelelo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolohe naafa yaafia, fofo sisa ofolale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lugu 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mad 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lug 11.33</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Inolo uleno alefasia naafa yaafia, fofo sisa ofolola? Me molobu sisa ofolola? Auba aulale. Ana diba ofolo. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mad 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lug 12.2</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, kegele sunia aga muguba dobumo, dufia ulufaeyobafe. Kegele aga gasiaguba dobumo, dufia ulufasi, babiyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Inolo sulu dubiyone konenida ga, doma.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mad 7.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, E saabia ilifea eweguba solu. “Sulu gili dobelefe ogo, nafuluba asigiba dimale. Aufia, gilihe no anogofea iminiba mefe amogubasu, Godehe gilifeada aubasu iminifia, sabe meba obegesia, noolo saabia gegoaba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mad 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lug 19.26</ref></char></note>Inolo abehe kegeleda sefia labemo, efea saabia noolo gegoaba meyobafe. Auluso, inolo kegeleda sebale labemo, kegele wedino e sebu amoda, efea sagoba diyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe edo gelu sobolo amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu saabia selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo, inolo uleno naiyo sebe geiya fifilo inolo amogulu labe. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Nigiliba e hanefia labida, yaida e degefia labida, sebe amo kau falagafasia, sobobasu ado. Falagafe halagubabi, sobofe halagubabi, inolo amo ene fadaba asigilale. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Geiya hele enesu alefasia, edo gelu sobomesi molosi, sebe helelo. Maugabamo, kau gaafia, saa holobagafasia, sebe bule amofea helelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Sebe amo gegenebimo, geleyo hilia adesi, gelu enao inigia, alebale helebe geleba dia maiyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe maseda sebemone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Madiyu 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lugu 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Aufia, Yesu saabia selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo, ninihe halaguba ulufaba saaba dafelagoyobi? Amone nini besi eneba saeyobi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Amo maseda sebegulu. Maseda sebe amo, kewalo sebe amogulu. Sebe weidesine, noolo helefealu iwi dobu amoguluale. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Amo maseda sebe weidesineso, fififasia sobosia, bule alefasia, edo gelu noolo alebaibumo sunialo. Odo dedalesimo, haga inigia, hisuiya ami molo dilo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe besi sulusu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:34-35">Madiyu 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesuhe idele inolofea besi sulu auba wedinale selesiamo, ine asigi dobu amone imini sodo. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />E idele inolofea besi sulusu selesia, besi sulu saabale, e ilifea kegele uleno soluale. Auluso, E Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilidai</char> ilibisu adesiamo, E kegele sunia ulufaba walelo.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu selesi, fufuloda hano fufuleluda gadaeyalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18">Madiyu 8.18</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lugu 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Hilia amoyamo geidesi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Nini waiyo egewi nolobalo anogolo segeba aasuba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Auba selesi, ili idele inolo wamilimo gadefia, ili hano kasu Yesuda asulu amohe kakainaba lagofia, daalu. Ausi, hano kasu nooloda ili aafeguba dedalelu. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Daaba labi, mogaifo bule inigia, hano fufulesia, galeba dowesia, hano kasu wasigaeyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Auba labi, Yesu E hano kasu miafealomo, guni mugulo ofasia, hanefia alolu. Hanefia labi, ili E degemasia, gilasia selesia, “Walelo! Nini hano gifiaeyo weiyaafe ewe! Ga nini hilisefalela?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Auba selesi, Yesu degefia, fufulofea gadifasia, hanofea halaleba selesia, “Hamaga! Ga gadaeama!” Auba selesi, fufulo gelesi, hano gadaealu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ausi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Gili sagilife ogo, enesi ause? Gili Nafea aso <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulualela</char>?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ausi, ili E baaba yagu kulukulufia, ine geleba sulu sugasia selesia, “Inolo ewe koleba abebi? Fufuloda, hanoda, E sulu selefemo sigiba dobolo besela?” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calms the storm" file="C068.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="4.35-41">Yesuhe fufulofeada, hano fufulelufeada gadaeamaba selefe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe gamododa alolu inolo uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Madiyu 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lugu 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Aufia, ili segeba abia, waiyo galubumone egewi nolobalo, Gelasa helea goalu. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Goafia, Yesu E hano kasu afasia, alebagosia, bosolufalumo, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane woluda</char> alolu uleno, inoloda baliya amifia ogoba sisiba, E mi gagiba goalu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Inolo amo, inolo baliya ami ado. Ilihe e dofaloso, seinida e dofaeyodoluale koleba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Maumo, ilihe e emoda, soneda, walale dofaloso, e alefasia seinida, sone walaleda, gegeleba dafalilo. Inolo uleno e seyo kiwida male alolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Hilia sunia, yaidada, nigilibada, e inoloda baliya ligia, me gale helea siba ligia, ene bado ene meleba subii gegeleba ligia, galagiliba ado.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />E Yesu aso hago anogo saabe waaga bafasia, naguba inigia, Yesune emo aniba sauba hanelu. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mag 1.24</ref></char></note>Aufia, e koleba sogaaba selesia, “Gode Ana Labe Lagone Faibemo, Yesu Ga! Ga nafea eneba moloyo hamefe? Na Godene si saabia, Gafea koleba selesu. Ga nafea naga memabiyo koleba.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />E auba sogaalu, mau enebamo, Yesuhe asubane wolufea inolo amo gadefia dedaleba yaamaba solu. <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Aufia, Yesuhe efea wanesia, “Ga wi abe?” E obegeba selesia, “Ne wimo, Yobolo Inolo Wedinale. Mau enebamo, nini inolo ewefea wedinale lolu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Aufia, e Yesufea saabia saabiaba susiba selesia, “Ga nini hele ewe afasia, dedalemesi asigamabuba solu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Dofene sogolugaba wedinale, hele kaufealo ami naiyo nabaiba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Aulugulu, <char style="w">gamodo</char> ilihe Yesufea susiba selesia, “Ga nini dofene anogofea waagi alibaiyo dedalemamaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea waagi dedalemalelu. Ausi, gamodo ilihe, inolo amo gadefia abia, dofenefea alibiaba yaalu. Ausi, dofene sogolugalu ili amo kiwigagaba naguba dedalesia, waiyo galulu egewine sailafealomo subaisalu. Aufia, ili hano galulu usu gifiaba danelu. Dofene amone alegalumo, saii aida (2,000) amogulu.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Dofeneda uluba ado ili amohe, molofe amo bafasia, ili fisaba dedalesia, dauno ami kakainalu ili amofea sulu amo saaba sigilu. Sulu auba selefe dofasia, idele inolo kegele halaguba koleba mololulaba babiyone milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Yesu labea goasia, bosolufalumo, <char style="w">gamodo</char> yobolo wedinaleda alolu inolomo, e asigi saabi, fagulo kaafia, yoba saabi bafasia, idele inolo ili sagililu. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Yesu molosi si abulu amo ilihe, idele inolo noolofea inolo gamododa alolumofea mololumo awaba melu. Dofenefea mololu amoda, awaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ili sulu amo dofasia, Yesufea susiba selesia, “Ga nine hele ewe gadefia nolobalo afa malaba” solu.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Auba selesi, Yesu E hano kasu aleba lagosi, inolo samini gamododa alolu amohe, Yesufea doba bisigia, “Nada Ga galiba miyobileba” susiba doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Auluso, Yesu e waagi milabusia selesia, “Ga ge mosomu saabea daafia, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Bulehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanuluba</char> ofelesia, kegele sunia gafea mololuguba, saaba meyo malaleba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Auba selesi, inolo amo abia, Dekabolisi helea ami, Yesu efea mololumone awaba selabia silu. Auba ausi, idele inolohe awalu amo dofasia, momoleba hiliselu.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ido sinohuluda alolumo waiba ofasia, ido faibe olalumoda degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Madiyu 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:41-56">Lugu 8.41-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesuda ili, hano kasuhe haiba saabia segeba abia, waiyo galulu nolobalo goasi, idele inolo wamili wedinale ilimo fuluba inigia, E amaleba waiyo galubu egewi ami gagaiyolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Auba labi, gulugululo molone guni inolo uleno, ene wi Yailusu, e Yesu bafasia, inigia, E aniba emo hugulumo sagaba asulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Aufia, ehe Yesufea susiba selesia, “Ne neleweli olaeyo hagoalefeme. Ga koleba Ge sone ogohe e geyone mila. E waifasia bebea mesesi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Auba selesi, Yesumo edai aasi, idele inolo wamili wedinalemo, E gegeba amaleba daalu.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ido uleno sino hulu daaba ligia, hamu huguluba alolumo, fuluba aafea aleba ami, eda daaba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ido ewehe dogoda inolo wedinale bea bobolasi, ili efea naga wedinale mesi, e ili elegesia mole bule weaseluso, ene walefa waisiale bulelu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ido amohe Yesu mololomo dubulugulu, e idele inolo fuluba aafea aleba amifia, Yesuda faisalo milifasia, Ene fagulo selale amo geba golu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />E ene meleba eweguba hiliselu. “Na sonesu Ene fagulo gesenaga, amo na waiyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />E Yesune fagulo gesufalumo, ibi miliba alolumo, alebale falalu. Ene domala ene eloba bisigia, walefa alolumo, aga gelefebuba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:19">Lug 6.19</ref></char></note>Auba molosi, Yesu alebale eloba bisigia, Ene kiwigagalu noolo E afasia aasi bafasia, E nolofasia selesia, “Ne fagulo abe gefe?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Auba selesi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Efea selesia, “Idele inolo dedelesia, Ga gegeba dedaleba labego, Ga besela? ‘Na gefe ewe abeba’ selesego, Ga enesi selese?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Auluso, Yesuhe Ene fagulo gelumo abebiba babiyone, aso bebelebasu alolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ido amo efea kegele mololumo asigifasia, e hidigifia sagilisia, kiwi bibilisi milifasia, Yesune emo sisa emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, e mololumo Efea fadaba saaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:52">Mag 10.52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:50">Lug 7.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:19">17.19</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ne neleweli, ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogohe, ga waiba ufulu. Ga waifia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> malale.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu E aso auba selaba ligia, bosolufalumo, inolo noolo Yailusune moloa amifia inigia, selesia, “Ge gelewelimo, ama olalume. Aulune, hama. Ga koleba Walelofea higinilu saabia no memabuba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Auluso, Yesuhe ili selefe amo dofasia, Yailusufea selesia, “Sagilimabu. Ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homa</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolo sunia milabiyofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, ili osoloasu, E galiba waagi miyone gadefalu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ili abia, guni inolo amone moloa ami goasia, yee gala wedinale dubulu. Ili wobasubale yegilisia waalesi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />E suga daafia ilifea selesia, “Gili enesi yegilisia, gala dafelese? Ido faibe ogo olaluale, e hanefia labe.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Auba selesi, ilihe E baaba galulu. Ausi, Yesuhe ili sunia baea malalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Aufia, E ido faibe amone enaoda, enaeda, Ene walelu faibili osoloa amoda, ili ido faibeda dobia lalolu ami sugalu. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:14">Lug 7.14</ref></char></note>Sugafasia, Yesuhe ido faibe amo sone gasifasia, selesia, “<char style="sls">Dalida kumi</char>.” Sulu amo eweguba besife, “Ido faibe, ga degema!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Auba selesi, ido faibe amo, hamu huguluba alolugulu, alebale degefia silu. Ausi, ili nokene koleba momoleba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Aufia, Yesu ilifea koleba selesia, “Gilihe inolo ulenofea mololu ewe saaba memabiyo.” Aufia, E ilifea selesia, “Ido faibe ewe naiyo noolo namenesi memaba” solu.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nasalede idele inolohe Yesune sulu sigiba dubuluale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Madiyu 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lugu 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu E mosomu amo afasia, Ene mosomule helea daalu. Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E galiba daalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:15">Yon 7.15</ref></char></note>Ami goafia, halemane ado <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> adesi, E <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> daafia, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana walelu. Amo dofasia, idele inolo wedinale hidigiba dobelesia selesia, “Wae! Kegele ogo moloyone kiwigagalumo, inolo ogo wagi dulubi? Dawaloloda, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molomesine kiwida, wagi ufulu difasia, inolo ogo molofebi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nini asigibu, inolo ogo, moloda dilo labe. E <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliane</char> faibe. Ene elewodalimo, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe 3,">Yoseseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[2]], Yudasa bugoda selelumo, e">Yudasada</char>, Saimonoda, Ene enanodalida, ninidai iwi alebaibu.” Idele inolo auba hilisesia, sulu E selefe amo, waaselaba dubulu.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yon 4.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">Saaba ofolomo</char> hele nolobalomo wida adoso, ene mosomuleda, ene moloa kolebada, e amimo widale adoba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Aufia, E momolelu kegele uleno hele ami moloyodoluale aloluso, walefalu inolo noolo ule uleba sone gesi wailu. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Aufia, Ene mosomule ili sigi dobelefale baafia, E ilifea keleba hilisesia, mosomu nolobalo ami walela siyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilimo dabalu molomesi hilibaisalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:9-14">Madiyu 10.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lugu 9.3-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Aufia, ili hugulubamo E labea milibaimafia, Ehe ili amofea <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> asigaeyone wida solu kiwida melu. Aufia, Ehe ili aida aidaba hilibaisalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8-9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lug 10.4-11</ref></char></note>E ili hilibaisasia selesia, “Gili emo saligalo saligafasia, kaidamo amosu sefia abiamo, kegele ulenoda dibale, alu agibale, naiyoda, moleda, fagulo hulianeda sebale malale. <verse eid="MRK 6:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Aufia, gili mosomu uleno goasia, molo uleno sugasenaga, molo amisu haneba ligia, mosomu amo gadefia abia hamale. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">HD 13.51</ref></char></note>Auluso, mosomu ulenone idele inolo ilihe gili heneba luba disalenaga, amo gili mosomu amo gadefia malale. Gili hele amo gadefia maiyo ligiamo, helesao ge emofea baabugo fifiba dafogomale. Ilihe ine mololumo heleba mololuba asigimesi.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda ilihe ine mana kuliba abia, helesao ine emofea baabumo fifiba dafelesuba sodomo, gine mana wolu mololumo ninifea baabualesia sodo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Auba malalesi, ili dedalefasia, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimaba</char> saaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yem 5.14</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w">gamodo</char> wedinale idele inolofea alolumo asigasia, walefa idele inolo wedinalefea walea hano heeba yaasi, ili wailu.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yone gifogolo gelelumone awalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Madiyu 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lugu 3.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mad 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mag 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19-20">Lug 9.19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> ehe Yesu molofemo, idele inolo suniahe sulu gi saaba sigisi dubulu. Noolo selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> olalumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelubu</char>. Aulune, e kiwigaafia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molofebuba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Noolo selesia, “E Elaiyabu”. Noolo selesia, “E <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo samini alolu amogulububa” solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Helodohe ili sulu saaba sigife dofasia, e selesia, “Yonemo, gifogolo na samini gele dafuluso, aga degelubu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.17-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:16">Wkp 18.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enebamo, samini Helodohe ene elewo Filibine eamono Helodiasa sagoba dulune, Yone efea selesia, “Ga gelewone ido fa sagoba dulu ogo, gahe muguli molomabiyolu sulu gelelububa” solubiyo. Ausi, Helodiasafea alefasia, Helodohe inolo noolo Yone seyo malafia, dibolo moloa seini dofafia ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Helodiasa asigi wofasia, ehe Yone dufiyo hiliseluso, moloyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Enebamo, Helodo Yone baaba sagilifia, e hilisesia, Yonemo inolo isolu <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> koleba labebuba hiliselu. Aulune, Helodohe Yone selefe dubiyo hamefiaso, asigi higinifia elawaneba dobolo.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Auluso, ido Helodiasa amo e Yone dufiyone eno isaba alolu. Dufia, Helodo e seba dulumone heneyo sigilo hilia adesi, eda ene gamane dabalu mololo ilida, aamine yasilo inolo ilida, Galili helene guni inolo ilida, heneba naiyo bule nabia gagaiyofia labi, Helodiasahe Yone dufiyone isalumo, fogo baaba golelu. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Aufia, ili gagaiyolu aleba ami, Helodiasane eleweli aulo udesi, Helodo eda, inolo noolo e galiba naiyo naba kakainalumo ilida, e aulo ululu bisigiamo hamelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Ausi, kini Helodohe ido budafea doba bisigia “Na gafea kegele, ga hamefegulu amene meyobi? Gene nafea saama. Na gafea meyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Helodohe efea eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba saaba</char> ofelesia, “Amene kegele sunia, ga nafea haalife amo, na gafea meyo. Gahe na yasifia biso lolu ewene osolaba memasenagada, amo na gafea meyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ido buda amo baea dafasia, enaefea eweguba doba abulu. “Na efea ene memaba saeyobiba” solu. Auba selesi, enae obegeba selesia, “Ga Hano Gelo Yone amone guni geleba memaba saamaleba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Auba selefe dofasia, ido buda amo ogoba sisiba obegeba daafia, saminilo Helodofea selesia, “Aga yagi Hano Gelo Yonene guni gelefasia, fofo saabia ofasia, memesi hamefe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Kinihe sulu amo dofasia, ene asigi higinilu. Auluso, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> saaba ufulumone asigisia, idele inolo ami kakainalu amone si saabia yualosifia, ido amone sulu saidafiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27-28" />Aufia, ehe alebale yobolo inolo uleno dibolo moloa daafia, Yonene guni gelefia, dia milalelu. Ausi, yobolo inolomo dibolo moloa goafia, Yonene gifogolo gelefia, ene gunimo fofo saabia ofasia dia abia, ido budamofea mesi, e enaefea meyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 6:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Yonene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilihe</char>, Helodo mololu sulu amo dofasia, ili milibaifasia, Yonene domala dibia abia baliba ufiyo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wamili saii biafea naiyo melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Madiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lugu 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yone 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:17">Lug 10.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, hilibaisalu faibilimo E labea obegeba milibailu. Milibaifasia, gagaiyofia, ilihe idele inolofea mololumoda, walelumoda, sunia Yesufea awaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Aufia, idele inolo wedinale noolo maiyo miyoba labi, walelu faibili ili naiyo naiyo fogo male adefe bisigia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Nini ninibisu inoloda maleiya heeba duluiya daafia, gili halemane mesesi aasuba” solu.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Auba safasia, ili ilibisu hano kasu aleba lagofia, inoloda maleiya heeba duluiya ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Auluso, idele inolo saludiale bisigia, Yesuda ili afa dedalefe amo baaba golelu. Auba bafasia, ili hele sunia amifia, ogoba sisiba hele aiba dedalefasia, Yesuda maiyoda aafea helea ami, saminiba goafasia, ili ami ama yasiba kakainalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mad 9.36</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Yesuhe hano kasu asulumone hugaba aleba ilogosia, bosolufalumo, idele inolo wamili ami gagaiyofia labi abulu. Ehe ili yagunagaba hilisesia, ili <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> uluba adoda malegulu alebaibuba hiliselu. Ausia, Ehe Godene sulu mana wedinale ilifea walelu.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:1-9">Mag 8.1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, dufia geidesi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili Yesu labea milifasia, selesia, “Iwi inoloda maleiya helegulu, naiyoda nabale hilia samodofe. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Aulugulu, Ga idele inolo wamili ogo, mosomu nolobalo hele aniba ami, naiyo ine naiyone elegemesi dedalemama.” Ili auba solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Auluso, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Ili ogofea naiyo namenesi, gine meba yaama.” Auba selesi, ilihe Efea eweguba obegeba solu. “Aube aaiyoba mole dabalu molofasia dilo amone ilililu, idele inolo ewene naiyo elegemesi selesela?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea dobelesia, “<char style="w">Boledi</char> halagia dobulaba isamaba” solu. Isalumo bafasia, ili inigia, Yesufea selesia, “Boledi bia, hani aida dobu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea idele inolo sogolugaba gisi saabia yoba kakainamalemaba solu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ausi, idele inolo noolo sogolugaba, daabulubasu daabuluba (100) yoba aselesi, noolomo sogolugaba, daabulubasu bia (50) yoba asulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Aufia, Yesuhe boledi bia amoda, hani aida amoda sefia, anakiwi baaba lagofia, Godedai henelu sulu saafia, boledi gogolelu. Auba gogolefia, Ene walelu faibilihe idele inolofea sagamesi melu. Aufia, hani aidamoda gogolefia, ilifea sagaba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ili sunia nabaisia kubaleba yaalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Aufia kubalesi, naiyo haisimo afelesi, walelu faibili ilihe molafia, fofo huguluba fofafasia diba walelu. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Hilia amoyamo inolo naiyoda mololumo, daosene bia (5,000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hano saabia mulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Madiyu 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yone 6.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Aufia, alebale koleba, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilimo</char> hano kasu aleba lagofia, ilidale hele Besaidafealo malalu. Aufia, Ehe idele inolo wamili ine helea dedalemalelu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:16">Lug 5.16</ref></char></note>Auba ilifea hawiyofia gadefia abia, E elebi Godedai sulu saeyone hele gale fela daalu. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Nigililabia sugasi, hano kasumo waiyo galulu dogolea daaba labi, Yesu E elebi hano egewi hamagi alolu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ami labi, fufulo bule inigia, hano kasufea doweba labine, Ene walelu faibili ili hano kasu olaboyo kolelu alolu. Aufemo Yesu baafia, hilialabia suga saabi, E waiyo galulu saabia ilifealo alebawelabia inigia, ili suniaeyofia mulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:37">Lug 24.37</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ene walelu faibili ilihe E hano saabia emo emelalabia saabe amo bisigia, sagilifia, iladalo saabesia galagililu.<verse eid="MRK 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ili sunia E baaba sagilisia, kiwi bibilisi, alebale hamagi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Ewe Na. Gili sagilimabiyo! Gine asigi kolefia gadaeama.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:39">Mag 4.39</ref></char></note>Yesu hano kasu aleba lagofia aselesi, fufulo bule miliba alolumo ami gelesi, ili sagilifia hidigisia elawanelu. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Mau ewe, Yesuhe idele inolofea naiyo buleba ufulumo abuluso, ili kiwi sisa nafuluba asigiba dulualene, ine asigi kolesiane babealu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hele Genesalede ami walefa inolo wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Madiyu 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ili hano kasuhe hano galulu segefia, hele Genesalede ami goafia, hano kasu godaiba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ili hano kasu asulumone egeisa aleba lagosi, idele inolohe alebale Yesu si galiba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Idele inolo noolo Yesu ami labeba solu dofasia, ili ogoba sisiba ine mosomia dedalefia, moloa walefalu waalelumo dafu adolu saabia ikaufia, Yesu labea dia milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Aufia, mosomu wedinoda, daunoda, hele suniada, Yesu Eda aafea ami, walefa kakainalu ili amo, naiyoda elegela helea ulubia milibailu. Ilihe Yesu fagulo haisideno gesenagada, waiyobafeba hilisefia, ene fagulo geyo susilu. Walefa idele inolo ili Yesuda gelumo, sunia wailu.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Gode molomalelu sulu amohe Yuda ine enauwadaline mana wasolu dobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Madiyu 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inolo nooloda, Yelusalame gadefia, Yesu labea gagaiyoyo milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:38">Lug 11.38</ref></char></note>Ili bisigia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> noolomo sone nuguma heebale, naiyo naafe abulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" /><char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomuda, Falisi inolo manada selu ilimo, sone nuguma heebale naiyo nolale. Ili ine enauwadaline mana fedoba sefia, auba mololo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:25">Mad 23.25</ref></char></note>Ili naiyoda elegela helea dedalefia obegesiada, nuguma heebale naiyo nolale. Aubale. Nuguma heefiasu, naiyo nolo. Aufia, ilihe ine enauwadaline mana nooloda kuliba abiamo, gaabuda, gofoda, disida, sunia hano selagobasu ado. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Aulugulu, Falisi ilida, muguli manane dawalolu inolo ilida, Yesufea eweguba doba abulu. “Ge walelu faibili ogo, nine nauwane mana ufuluguba kuliba abiale, sone nuguma heebale naiyo naafe ogo, mau enene aufe?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ais 29.13</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> seale koleba solumo, gili masega gegelo inolo iminisia, sulu eweguba seleba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 7:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="qt">‘Idele inolo ili ewemo Ne wi digiba selesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="qt">mofe balu selesiaso, ine asigine libomo Nadai koleba hago ado.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />
    <char style="qt">Ili walesiamo, inolone molomalelu sulu amosu walelogulu,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="qt">ili Nafea balu guluguluba ado.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 7:7" />
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 7:7">Aisaiahe auba seleba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Gili Godene sulu mana afasia, inolone manasu kiwigaaba sefia labe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu ilifea sulu gegoaba selesia, “Gilihe inolone manasu kuliba maiyosia, Godene molomalelu sulu afafafealo ofogose ogo. Wae! Gili nafulu kolebabu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kis 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Lo 5.16</ref></char></note>Enebamo, <char style="w">Mosese</char> sulu muguli eweguba saaba ufulu. <char style="qt">‘Gaedai gaodai sisa alefasia, aine sulu nafuluba kuliba malale. Aufia, enaedai enaodaifea sowaneba selefe inolo amo, e olaeyo dobu.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11-12" />Auluso, gilihe molomalelu sulu amone gegoaba eweguba sodobiyo. Inolo ulenohe enaedai enaodaifea selesia, ‘Na kegele ewe aalifea sagoba ofelesia mebaiyoso, na kegele amo Godefea ulu meyone iminiba ufuluba’ selesenaga, amo gili Falisi selesia, ‘Amo nafulu, sulu e auba iminiba selefe amomo, enaedai enaodai aine sisa melaleba muguli sulu amone afelesia, e kegele amo aalufea meyodolumone afelefe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Gili auba soluso, Na gilifea eweguba selesu. Gili gine gauwadaline mana bulebuba hilisesia, auba molofemo Godene Sulu Muguli waaselaba bisigia, dufa dafogoba ado. Aufia, gili mana ewesuale mololo. Nooloda wedinale aubasu mololo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolone ilibo nuguma baalomone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Madiyu 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Sulu amo saafia, Yesuhe idele inolo gagaiyomafia, ilifea selesia, “Gili sunia Na selesu ewe dofasia, nafuluba asigima. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15-16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:14-15">HD 10.14-15</ref></char></note>Kegele egeisafia inolofea sugafe amo inolo nugumaba ofolale. Aubale. Kegele inolofeafia egeisa holobagafe amohe, inolo nugumaba ofolo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesuhe idele inolo sogolugalumo afasia, moloa goasi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilihe</char> Efea besi solumone doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />E ilifea selesia, “Gili wagada asigidalela? Kegele egeisiafia inolofea sugafe amo inolo nugumalalemo, gili bolalela? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Auba selesumo, mau ewe. Naiyo naafemo, inolone asigifea sugalale. Aubale. Galisalo sugafia, gali eeba dafolo.” Yesu auba selefe ewehe, naiyo sunia aiyalale dobusia selefe.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesuhe gegoaba selesia, “Kegele inolofeafia holobagafe amohe, inolo nugumaba ofolo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21-22" />Maumo, inolone asigifeafia egeisa holobagalomo, amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 7:21-22" />
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Asigi woluda,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Fadilo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Inolo dufa olalo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Mana wolu nokene nokenebamoda,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Susugu nokene nokene mololo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Asigi elawanefia kagoalugulu mololomoda,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">None kegele sigilo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Ido fa dilo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Mesegelo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Libo degelo manada,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Asigi gogololomoda,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Soaneba sodomoda,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 7:21-22">Na-ba balalilomoda,<verse eid="MRK 7:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Wolu sunia selesu amo, inolone asigifeafia egeisa holobagafe amohe, inolo nugumalo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hele Fonisia ido Yesufea asigi ule ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Madiyu 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Auba walefasia, Yesuda ili hele amo gadefia, Daila sidi aniba maiyone daalu. E ami goafia, inolo uleno E bolosifia, molo uleno muguba misiyo daaluso, muguba misiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Alebale koleba, ido uleno, eleweli <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane woluda</char> alolumo, Yesu muluba solu dofasia, e Yesu labea milifasia, ene emo sisa emo hugulumo sagaba asulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ido ewe Giligi ido ligia, Fonisia Silia helea ami seba dulu alolu. Ehe Yesufea susiba selesia, “<char style="w">Gamodo</char> ne neleweli amofeafia asigaba dafiyone milaleyobile?”<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Faibe deseine ilidale kubalemesi naiyo meyo dobu. Ninihe faibene naiyomo difasia, gesodalifea saidafogoyo, amo isoluale.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Faibe deseine </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amogulumo, Isolaele mosomu. Geso amogulumo, amo yau mosomu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Sulu amone dobelesia, ido amohe Efea obegeba selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga seale selefeso, faibe deseinehe naiyo nabia sao hodobaisalumo, geso alibaea labemohe keleba naiyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Auba selesi, E ido amofea selesia, “Ga sulu nafulu obegeba selefe ogo alefasia, gelewelifea gamodo felalumo gadefia daalugulu, ga obegeba mala.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ido amo moloa obegeba daafia, bosolufalumo, gamodo alolumo daafia labi, ene eleweli molobia nafulu hanefia labi abulu.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe konenida kaalu inolo sulu dedabealeba sodomo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Aufia, Yesuda ili Daila sidi hele ami afasia, Saidono sidi suniaba abia, Dekabolisi goalabia abia, Galili waiyo galulu dobia goalu. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ami goasi, inolo noolohe, inolo uleno konenida kaalu suluda dedabealeba sodomo, Yesu efea sone gemesifia ulubia mulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesuhe inolo amo uluba difasia, sogolugalumo afasia, aalibisu ligia, Ehe Ene sone gaso inolomone koneni eno aidamo gefasia, gau fodosia ene eane gelu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Aufia ligia, Yesu E <char style="w">Hebene</char> lago baaba lagosia, hame heeba dafelesia, selesia, “<char style="sls">Efada</char>ba” solu. Sulu amo eweguba besife, “Sogoba dama!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ausi, alebale hamagi, inolo amone koneni kaalumo sogoba dafelesia, ene eane kaliba kaulumo isoba ofelesi, sulu nafulu solu. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:43-45">Mag 1.43-45</ref></char></note>Yesuhe ilifea E mololumo awaba samabiyoba soluso, ili kiwigaaba saaba sigilu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Ais 35.5</ref></char></note>Ili nokene momoleba selesia, “Kegele E molofemo, sunia nafulusu molofe. Ehe konenida kaalumo sulu domesi sogoba ofelefe. Eaneda kaliba kaulumo sulu samesi isoba ofelefe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo wamili saii binibafea naiyo melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Madiyu 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:35-44">Mag 6.35-44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia fogo amo, idele inolo wamili saabia gagaiyofia ligia, naiyo male adesi, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> milafia, ilifea selesia, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nahe idele inolo ili ewe yagunagafe. Ili ewe Nadai ligia, hilia osoloa alolune, ilimo naiyoda male adefe. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Aulugulu, Nahe ili naiyo mebale, ine moloa malalesenaga, amo ili eno aiba dedaleba ligia, mamiasia kiwi saneba yaeyobafe. Mau enebamo, noolo hele hagofia milibailune.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ene walelu faibilihe Efea obegeba selesia, “Iwi inoloda maleiya helegulu, <char style="w">boledi</char> ili liliba namenesimo, wagi ufulu diyobi?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Auba selesi, Yesu ilifea doba bisigia, “Gili boledi halagia sebu?” Ili obegeba selesia, “Domoba sebuba” solu.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolofea selesia, “Gili hele saabia yoba kakainamaba” solu. Aufia, E boledi domobamo sefia, Godedai henelu sulu safasia, boledi gogolefia, Ene walelu faibilifea mesi, ili difasia idele inolofea sagalu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Hani deseine noolo selu amoda difasia, Yesuhe henelu sulu saafia, Ene walelu faibilifea amoda sagamalu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Idele inolo naiyo nafasia kubalesi, gogolelu haisi afolumone, ili molalumo, fofo domoba wasigafia, fofabagalu. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9-10" />Inolo naiyoda mololu ili amone alegalumo, saii biniba amogulu (4,000). Yesuhe ili amo ine helea dedalemalefia, Eda Ene walelu faibilida, ili alebale hano kasu aseba lagofia, Dalamanuda heleafealo daalu.<verse eid="MRK 8:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hebenefia mululaba eloba babiyone, ilihe Efea momolelu kegele molomaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Madiyu 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Ami goafia labi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo milibaifia, Yesudai hegeyone maugasia, ilihe E dedeba bisigia selesia, “Ninihe Ga Godefea alefasia dabalu molofelaba eloba bamesine, Ga koleba <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> ninifea walemaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mad 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lug 11.29</ref></char></note>Yesu E habosia, hame heefia selesia, “Idele inolo aga ewe eloba bamesine momolelu kegele walemafe ogo, mau enesi aufebi? Auluso, eloba bamesine momolelu kegele uleno gilifea waleyobafale. Aubale.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Auba safasia, E ili gadefia, hano kasu aseba lagofia, hano galulu nolobalo segeba daalu.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Falisi inolodai Helododaine falawa bulelo yisi amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Madiyu 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ene walelu faibili ilihe <char style="w">boledi</char> seyo galiluso, boledi subulu uluse aso hano kasu ufia alolu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lug 12.1</ref></char></note>Yesuhe ilifea hagugulu sulu eweguba solu. “Gili nafuluba yasimale. <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisine</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yisi">yisida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodone</char> yisida, amo baaba nafuluba yasimale.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Auba selesi, ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Nini boledi subulu selualene selefebuba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:52">Mag 6.52</ref></char></note>Yesuhe ili nenefemone hilisefia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Mau enene gili boledi sebualeba selese? Gili aso fadaba bisigiale, asigiba difalela? Gine asigi aso kolelu elela? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Gilifea si labeso, kegele bolalela? Gilifea koneni gaabuso, sulu dobolalela? Kegele sunia Na mololumo, gili asigiba obegefalela? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:41-44">Mag 6.41-44</ref></char></note>Nahe inolo saii biafea naiyo meiya ami, gili boledi gogolelu haisi afolumo, fofo halagia fofaba waalelu?” Auba selesi, ili selesia, “Hugulubaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Ausi, Yesu saabia selesia, “Boledi domoba gogolefia, inolo saii binibafea meiya ami, haisi afolumo fofo halagia fofaba waalelu?” Ili selesia, “Domobaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ausi, E ilifea selesia, “Gili aso asigiba difalego, enesi ause?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hele Besaida ami si kalalu uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ili Besaida ami goasi, inolo noolohe si kalalu inolo uleno Yesufea waiba homesi ulubia inigia, Efea sone gemaba susilu. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Aufia, Yesuhe si kalalu inolomo sone gasifia, mosomu afasia, egeisialo ulubia daalu. Ami ligia, Ehe inolo ene sifea gau fodofia, Ene sone efea gelu. Aufasia, E efea eweguba doba abulu. “Ga kegele nafuluba besabela?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ausi, inolo amo bebelefia selesia, “Na inolo bosoluso, fufuneba bisigia, ili i dolanefegulu bosolu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe saabia inolo amone sifea Ene sone gesimo, inolo amone simo waisi, si galiba sidasia, kegele sunia nafuluba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Auba molofasia, Yesuhe e malasia, selesia, “Mosomu faseba sugasiale, gene moloa mala.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesune wi amoba ulufaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-16">Madiyu 16.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lugu 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesuda Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ili hele Sisalia Filibai helea ami, mosomu noolo aniba ami siba alolu. Ili ami siba ligia, Yesuhe ilifea eweguba doba abulu. “Idele inolo ilimo, Na abeba selefe?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:15">Mag 6.15</ref></char></note>Walelu faibili ili obegeba selesia, “Noolo selesiamo, ga <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonebuba</char> selesi, noolo selesiamo, ga Elaiyabuba selesi, noolo selesiamo, Ga <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ulenomobuba selaba yaafe.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yon 6.68-69</ref></char></note>Walelu faibili auba selesi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Auluso gilimo, Na abeba selese?” Yesuhe auba doba besabi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> obegeba selesia, “Ga-mo <char style="w">Keliso</char> labe, Godehe iminifia molobebelelu inolo, amo Ga.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:9">Mag 9.9</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Inolo ulenofea Na amobuba ulufaba samabiyo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe E olafia haiba degeyone maugaba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Madiyu 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lugu 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Auba saafia, Yesuhe ilifea eweguba waleyone maugalu. “<char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibe</char> naga wedinale diyo dobumo, guni inolo ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inolo ilida, ilihe Efea faiso mesia, E dufa olaeyobafe. Aufia, hilia osoloa alefasia, E haiba degeyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />E sulu amo auba ulufaba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Yesu anibalo lubia daafia, Efea halaleba selesia, “Auba samabiyoba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ausi, Yesu nolofasia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> bebelesia, Fidafea halaleba eweguba solu. “<char style="w">Sedene</char>, ga Na faisalo mala! Maumo, ga Godene asigi kuliba abiale, inolone asigisu kuliba aafe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38-39">Mad 10.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lug 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Fidafea auba safasia, Ehe idele inolo gagaiyolumoda, Ene walelu faibilida, E labea milafasia, ilifea sulu eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe Na kuliba miyo hamesenaga, ene hamemo dufa dafogofia, ene <char style="w">imolane</char> ene digifia, e koleba Na kuliba milale. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Mau enebamo, uleno abehe, ene miliyolu fedoba seyo hilisesenaga, amo e ene miliyolu daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe, Ne wi saabiada, awalu sulu nafulu ewene saabiada, ene miliyolu weasesenaga, amo e seale miliyolu seyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Maumo, inolo ulenohe helefealune kegele sunia difasia sefia ligia, ene miliyolumo woba dafelesia, daba dafelesenaga, kegele sunia e dulu amohe, e halaguba sagoba ufiyobafebi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Inolohe ene miliyolu obegeba diyone, su amenegulu suluba meyo dobubi?<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mad 10.33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Uleno abehe, Godefea faiso mefe mosomu aleba ami yoba sigiamo, Nafeada, Ne sulu manafeada, baaba yuasenaga, amo dufia Inololene Faibe Enaone yane <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char>, Godene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">sulu dia anoda</char> galiba, saabe fogo ami, Ehe inolo amo sabe baaba yuaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 13:30">Mag 13.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, inolo noolo aga iwi labemo aso olabale ligia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo kiwigagaludai maugasi babiyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune domalamo noekene elalesi abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Madiyu 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lugu 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Fid 1.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:22">HD 3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia kaabeba alefasia, Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, ili ulubia abia, hele gale uleno ana digiba lagolumo, ilibisu felafia ami alolu. Aufia, ilihe sidafia ligia, bosolufalumo, Yesune domalamo noekene koleba dedegesi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ene fagulo kaalumoda, sunia hoosia, si dabeleyodolu labi abulu. Helefealu inolo ulenoda helefagulo hano heesimo, hoolu amogulu koleba adale. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ili amo sidaba labi, Elaiyada, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Moseseda</char>, aalumo hamagi holobagafia, Yesudai sulu sugalu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Fidahe amo bafasia, Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, nini iwi lolu, amo nafulubu. Aulugulu, ninihe hisuba misiyone molo wedino osoloa iwi diyoba. Ulenomo Ge, aufia ulenomo Mosesene, aufia ulenomo Elaiyane.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Fidada ili amo sagilisia, e sulu amene saeyobiba babeafia ligia, balu auba solu. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Auba saafia labi, kene inigia, ili gasiagulu. Kene usu amifia, sulu goo uleno eweguba selesi dubulu. “Ewe ne Naalo, E Ne yaguso koleba. Gilihe E selefemo domale.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Auba dofasia, ili bebelesia, bosolufalumo, inolo no bisigiale, Yesu Elebisu ili galiba labi abulu. <figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration" file="C075.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="9.2-4">Yesune domalamo noekene elalesi besabe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Aufia, ili hele galeafia huga inigiamo, Yesuhe ilifea koleba selesia, “Gili aga abulumo, inolo ulenofea aso awaba memabiyo. Auba awabale abia, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> olafasia haiba degeba ifofia labi elomale.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ilihe Yesu sulu solumo, ili diba sefia ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Olafasia haiba degeyoba solumo enebi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mau isasia, ilihe Yesufea eweguba doba abulu. “<char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilihe selesia, ‘Elaiya edale miyobafeba’ sodomo, mau enene auba sodo?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Sulu ewe seale, Elaiya e kegele sunia isoba haiba momoloyone miyobafe. Auluso, Inololene Faibe amone saaba sulu eweguba seleba ufulu dobu. E naga wedinale disi, idele inolo ilihe E golaba babiyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mad 11.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na gilifea eweguba selesu, Elaiya e mulu aloluso, inolo ilihe e eloba abuluale. Aubale. Ine hamefeguba kuliba abiane, ilihe mana efea nokene nokeneba mololuso. Samini Godene Bugohe e saaba sulu seleba ufuluguba iminiba holobagalu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe asubane woluda alolumo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Madiyu 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-45">Lugu 9.37-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Aufia, Yesuda ili galeafia huga inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> noolo labea goasia, bosolufalumo, idele inolo wamilimo hegoba galifia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inolohe</char> ilidai hegeba labi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Idele inolo sunia Yesu saabe bisigia, hidigifia, alebale E wakaliyofia naguba dedalelu.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea eweguba doba bisigia, “Gili ilidai sulu hegeba elego, ene selese?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Auba doba besabi, inolo uleno wamili aleba ami alolumo, Efea selesia, “Walelo, ne faibemo asubane wolu ligia, mofeyo kaafia labemo, na Ga labea ulubia mulu. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Asubane wolu alefasia, hele saabia feseba ligia, mofeyo subu gagaba, bese hegeleba, domala kakaloba dilogulu, na ge walelu faibilifea asubane wolu amo asigamesifia doba abuluso, ili asigaeyodolualebiyo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Auba selefe dofasia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Asigi ule ufuluale mosomu, gili! Na gilifea habofia ligia, aso fogo halaguba waagi gilidai miliyobi? Na gili gadefia daabale ligia, fogo halaguba aso miliyobi? Faibe ogo Na labea lubia mila.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Auba selesi, ilihe faibe amo E labea lubia mulu. Alebale hamagi, asubane wolumohe Yesu bafasia, faibe amo dibia hele gauasia, emo yadosia, subu gagalabia besibesilu. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesuhe faibe enaofea doba bisigia, “E eweguba ligia, fogo halaguba alolu?” Enao obegeba selesia, “E aso faibe wedino waagifia maugalu. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />E kagoabasu ligiamo, asubane woluhe e de fafuba dafogoyoba, hano fafuba dafogoyoba ligia, ene meleba dufa olamesiba moloba ado. Aulugulu, Gahe kegele uleno moloyodolunaga, amo Ga ani yagunagasia koleba sagoba homa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mad 21.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mag 11.23</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Ga Nafea ‘Ga kegele uleno moloyodolunagaba’ selesela? Na gafea eweguba selesu. Uleno abehe <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesimo</char>, efea kegele sunia moloyodolusu dobu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Auba selesi, alebale hamagi, faibe enao obegeba selesia, “Na asigi ule ofelesuso, na asigi ule ofelefale amone sagoba homa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamili milibaisi baafia, Ehe <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> amofea halaleba selesia, “Mofeyoda, konenida kaaba ofolo asubane wolu, ga doma! Ga faibe ewe gadefia afa mala! Aufia, ga efea miliyone obegeba faseba milabiyo!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:26">Mag 1.26</ref></char></note>Asubane wolu amohe koleba sogaafia, faibe amo yadofia kakalolu olalugulu dobi, e gadefia daalu. Ausi, idele inolo selesia, “E olalububa” solu. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Auluso, Yesuhe faibe amo sone gasiba lagosi, e degelu. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Aufia, Yesu Eda Ene walelu faibilida molo usu suga daafia, ilibisu ligia, ilihe Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Asubane wolu amo, ninihe asigaeyodoluale amo, enesi aulubi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />E selesia, “Asubane wolu amogulu asigaeyonemo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesisu</char> holobagaba daafia maiyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu aganebo saabia selesia, E olafia haiba degeyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Madiyu 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lugu 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:1">Yon 7.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba safasia, ili hele ami afasia, Galili heleafealo suniaba daalu. Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili waleba ligiane, inolo ulenohe E ami labebuba asigimesiale hamelu. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mag 8.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">10.32-34</ref></char></note>Ehe ilifea walesia, “Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> holonofia, inolone sone saabia ofelesi, ilihe e dufa olafasia labi, E hilia osoloa alefasia haiba degeyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:45">Lug 9.45</ref></char></note>Auba soluso, ilihe E solu amo sisa fadaba asigiba dibale alolu. Ausi, Ehe ilifea sulu amone sawaba samesi, ilihe Efea doba babiyomo sagililu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini aleba ami saminiba waseba miliyomo abe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Madiyu 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lugu 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Aufia, ili Kafanima dauno ami goafia, molosu suga daafia ligia, Yesuhe ilifea doba bisigia, “Gili eno aiba inigia, nenelabia saabeomo, sulu amene selesia solu?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Auba doba abuluso, ili eno aiba inigiamo, nini aleba, abe olaibo labebilesia hegelabia mulune, ilihe Yesufea obegeba saeyomo yuasia, sulu soluale. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24-26">Lug 22.24-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mad 20.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">Mag 10.43-44</ref></char></note>Yesu E aseba ilogofia, faibili hugulubamo milafia, ilifea eweguba solu. “Inolo uleno samini waseba miliyo hilisesenaga, amo e dufia koleba alefasia, inolo noolo sunia asigifia, ine balu dabalu moloba ofolo miliyo dobu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Aufia, Yesuhe faibe wedino ulenomo ili aleba ami ifofia, fafuba seba ligia, ilifea selesia, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mad 10.40</ref></char></note>“Uleno abehe, Na asigisia, faibe wedino ewegulu heneba luba disenaga, ehe Na heneba luba dife. Aufia, inolo abehe Na heneba luba difemo, Na-su heneba luba difale. Nada hilibailumo, Eda heneba luba dife.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo ninidai gisa labalemo, e nine damene labe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lugu 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonehe</char> selesia, “Walelo, ninihe inolo uleno ge wi saabia <char style="w">gamodo</char> asigaba dafaliba labi baafia, e nini galiba alolualene, efea kaamaba solu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Gilihe auba kaamabiyo. Maumo, inolo ulenohe Ne wi saabia <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molofe amo, e alebale Nafea woba saeyobafale. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mad 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lug 11.23</ref></char></note>Enebamo, inolo ninidai gisa labalemo, amo nine damene labe. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mad 10.42</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, uleno abehe, gili bisigia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> mosomu labeba hilisesia, sagoba ofelesia, hano gaabu wasulu uleno gilifea mesenaga, amo inolo amone elebemo asigileyobafale.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana woluhe asigi ule ufulu woba ofolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Madiyu 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lugu 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Yesuhe sulu saabia kuliba selesia, “Inolo ulenohe, faibe deseine ewegulu Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char>, wolu molomesi gelebaiba ofelesenaga, amo ilihe inolo amofea sabesia, ene dogaeyofea abane baliama godaifia, e waiyo galulu gifiamesi dafogosiabiaga, amo nafulu koleba babaiye.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.43-44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mad 5.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ge sone ogohe, ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo ga sone ogo geleba damale. Maumo, ga sone maualu ligia, miliyolu miliyo disenaga, nafulu. Auluso, ga sone aida ligia, hele woiya de usulale waiyaba labea ami aasenaga, amo wolu koleba. <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46" />Aufia, ge emo ogohe, ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo ge emo ogo geleba damale. Ga emo maualu ligia, miliyolu miliyo disenaga, nafulu. Auluso, ga emo aida labihe, ili ga hele woiya ami saidafogosenaga, amo wolu koleba. <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mad 5.29</ref></char></note>Aufia, ge si ogohe, ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo ga si ogo duguba damale. Ga si ulesu ligia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada faseba aasenaga, amo nafulu. Auluso, ga si aida labi, ilihe ga hele woiya saidafogosenaga, amo wolu.<verse eid="MRK 9:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:24">Ais 66.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="qt">Hele woiya ami ibili olasia asigilelale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="qt">Hele amimo deda usulale.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Aufia, Yesu sulu gegoaba selesia, “Ilihe kelebulu ulu soba meyone ligia, amo Godene si saabia galagololu melesifia, kelebulu amofea salu ofolo. Amogubasu, de idele inolo suniafea holobagaeyo dobu. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mad 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Lug 14.34</ref></char></note>Salu e nafulu kegele koleba. Auluso, ene nenalebalu asigilesenaga, salu amo haiba nenalebalu melesi, nini kegele uleno moloyodoluale koleba. Amogubamo, gili salugulu alefasia, gine geleba hamesefia aeaba melale.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ido dulu duguba dafolomone mana solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Madiyu 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lugu 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu hele amo afasia, Yudia heleafealo inigiamo, Hano Yodene segefasia, egewi nolobalo mulu. Ami daaba labi, idele inolo wedinale saabia gagaiyolumo, E galiba milibaisi, Ehe Ene mana molologuba ilifea waleba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Aufia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo noolo Yesu labea milifasia, E dedeba bisigia, eweguba doba abulu. “Inolohe ido dulumo ene hamefeguba duguba dafiyomo isobula, me auba molomabiyolula?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu obegeba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> amone gilifea eneba molomalelu?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Lo 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mad 5.31</ref></char></note>Ili obegeba selesia, “Mosesehe eweguba waagi molomalelu. <char style="qt">‘Inolo ene eamono duguba dafiyo hilisesenaga, e duguba dafiyone beba selefia, idofea mesia, afa malaleba saeyo dobu.’</char>”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Auluso, Yesu selesia, “Gine libo kolefia elelilo labe baafia, Mosesehe molomalelu sulu auba selelu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Stt 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note>Auluso, amakelemo, Godehe kegele sunia maugaba dofelesiamo, <char style="qt">Ehe inolodai idodai mololu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Stt 2.24</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31-33">Efe 5.31-33</ref></char></note><char style="qt">Ehe auba mololune, inolohe enaodai enaedai afasia, eamonodai kuliba ofolo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><char style="qt">Auba ausimo, aalumo domala ule ado.</char> Aulugulu, aalumo aida saabia no adesiale, domala ule adefe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Aulugulu, kegele Gode kuliba ufulumo, inolohe geleba damabiyo.” Yesu auba solu.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Aufasia, Yesuda ili moloa goafia sigia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Efea amone doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mad 5.32</ref></char></note>E ilifea selesia, “Uleno abehe, ene eamono duguba dafasia, ido no disenaga, amo e ido samini dulumofea woba ofelesia, susugu molofe. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ido ulenohe ene aino afasia, inolo nofea aasenaga, amo e susugu molofe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe deseinemo E labea milibaimaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Madiyu 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lugu 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Idele inolohe faibe deseinemo Yesuhe ili sone gemesifia ulubia milibailu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe idele inolofea halaleba selesia, faibe ulubia milibaimabusia kaalu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu amo baafia, Ene walelu faibilifea gadisia selesia, “Faibe deseine ogo Na labea waagi milibaimalema. Gilihe ili ogo kaamabu. Aubale. Maumo, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo inolo faibe deseine ewegulu adefe amone dobu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mad 18.3</ref></char></note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu. Inolo uleno faibe deseinegulu adesalenaga, amo e Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada usu ami faseba sugaeyobafale.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Auba safasia, Ehe faibe deseinemo fafuba sefia, Ene sone ine gunia ufia ligia, ili <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba</char> waalelu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with children" file="C076.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="10.13-16">Yesuhe faibe deseinemo E labea milibaimaba solu.</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elebeda ufulu inolo Yesudai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Madiyu 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lugu 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu maiyofia daaba labi, inolo uleno naguba milifasia, E labea emo hugulumo sagaba sigia selesia, “Walelo nafulu, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> diyone, na eneba molosi, diyobafebi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu efea selesia, “Enesi ga Nafea nafuluba selese? Inolo uleno nafulu male. Gode ule elebisu nafulu labe. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-17">Kis 20.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Lo 5.16-20</ref></char></note>Godehe molomalelu sulu muguli saaba ufulumo, ga asigibu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 10:19" />
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Inolo dufa olamabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Ido fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Kegele fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">No anogofea masega godomabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">None dobu anogo elasabiafia balaliba dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MRK 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Gaedai gaodai sisa ligia, aine sulu kuliba malale.</char>”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Yesu auba selesi, inolo amo selesia, “Walelo, na aso faibe wedino waagifia adabia inigia, Godehe molomalelu sulu amo na sunia kuliba abia mololo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe e si galiba sidasia, kanuluba hamesefia, efea selesia, “Ga kegele uleno mololualemone, aso moloyo dobu. Ge kegele dobu ogo, sunia elegeba samodofia, mole ga dife amo weagulu ili amofea memale. Ga auba molosenaga, gahe kegele nafulu koleba, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ge samolo diba ufiyobafe. Auba molofasia, ga Na kuliba milale.” Yesuhe auba solu. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Sulu amo dofasia, inolo amone olegi augifia, ene libo higinifia, afa daalu. Maumo, ehe elebe wedinale koleba ufulune aulu. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ausi, Yesuhe bebelesia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Elebeda ufulu inolomo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugaeyomo kolelu koleba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Walelu faibili ilimo, Yesu sulu solumo dofasia hidigisi, Ehe ilifea haiba saabia solu. “Ne faibili, gili doma! Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami suga maiyomo, kolelu koleba. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kelebulu hagolu bule, <char style="w" lemma="Kamele">kamelemo</char>, asogolo aleba eno sugaeyomo lilibula? Lilibuale. Amogubasu, elebeda ufulu inolo uleno, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugaeyomo, kolelune kolelu koleba.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ene walelu faibilihe sulu amo dofasia, wobasubale hidigifia, ine geleba nenefia selesia, “Amo aulunaga, ule abe, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char> miliyobafebi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesuhe ili selefemo dofasia, ili sidafia ligia selesia, “Inolomo auba moloyodoluale labe, auluso Godemo moloyo lililu labe. Enebamo, Gode kegele sunia liliba moloyodolu labe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> selesia, “Doma, nini Ga kuliba miyone, kegele sunia nini ufulumo afasia milibailu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29-30" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe selesia, “Sulu ewe gilifea seale koleba selesu. Uleno abehe, Ne wida, Ne sulu nafuluda, hilisesia abia, moloda, elewoda, enanoda, enaeda, enaoda, ene faibeda, ene edo geluda, kegele amogulu gadefia aafemo, amo e kegele hamagulu daabulubasu daabuluba (100) obegeba diyobafe. Aga ili helefealu iwi aso ligiamo, ilihe disiamo, molo wedinaleda, elewodalida, enanodalida, enaedalida, faibedalida, edo geluda wedinale diyobafe. Auluso, naga amoda diyobafe. Aufasia, hilia nafulu dufia adesimo, ili miliyolu miliyo diyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 10:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mad 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lug 13.30</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolo wedinale aga olaibo ligia, samini labe ili amo, dufia ili faisalo ligia, sia miliyobafe. Aufia, inolo wedinale aga sia ligia, faisalo labe ili amo, dufia samini ligia, olaibo miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu osolo saabia selesiamo, E olafia haiba degeyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Madiyu 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lugu 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mag 8.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9.31</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, ili Yelusalame maiyone eno aiba daaba ligia, Yesu E saminiba daaba labi, Ene walelu faibilihe keleba hiliselabia dedalesi, ilida kuliba dedaleba alolu ilimo, sagililabia dedalelu. Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili eno egewifealo uluba difasia, kegele Efea moloyobafemo ilifea saaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />E selesia, “Aga nini Yelusalame fela maiyo dedalesu. <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo ulu <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ine sone saabia ufiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe E fadaasia, E dufa olaeyoba selesia, osolaba dafiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe E <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau inolofea</char> seba meyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ausi, ili amohe Efea baaba gaidesia, gau fodosia, efolo fegofia, E dufa olaeyobafeso, hilia osoloa alefasiamo, E haiba degeyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yemesedai Yonedaihe Yesufea doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Madiyu 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Sebedine faibe <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, Yesu labea daafia Efea selesia, “Walelo, anihe Gafea doba besabeguba koleba, Ga molomesi hamefe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Auba selesi, Yesu aalufea doba bisigia, “Na aalifea ene molomesi selese?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Aalu Efea obegeba selesia, “Ga <char style="w">elalelu</char> aselesiamo, ani, nomo ge sone inaloalofealo, nomo ge sone fofonaloalofealo, ami yoba sigia yasimesi waagi gadefama.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mag 14.36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Lug 12.50</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Kegele gili Nafea haalife ogo, gili mau fadaba hilisebuale. Nagamo, Nahe, gaabu wasulu nologuba, naiyobasumo, aalida naiyo lilibula? Aufia, Na <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geloguba</char>, olaeyobasumo, aalida auba olaeyo ililibula?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:2">HD 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:9">MUU 1.9</ref></char></note>Aufia, aalu Efea obegeba selesia, “Ani ililibuba” solu. Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Seale, Ne gaabu wasulumo, aalida naiyobafe. Aufia, aalida olaeyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Auluso, abe Ne sone inaloalofealo misiyomoda, me Ne sone fofonaloafealo misiyomoda, amo Na waagi iminiba saeyodoluale. Aubale. Ami misiyobafe amo, Godehe Ene daiyalu amonesu madeneba dobu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ili daabuluba noolomohe, Yemesedai, Yonedai, aalu auba haalilumo dofasia, ili aalufea gadilu. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Lug 22.25-26</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ili E labea weba gagaiyofia, ilifea selesia, “Gili asigibu, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> suniane yasilohe, kiwigagafia ine mosomu yasilo. Ine saminilohe kiwigaasia, idele inolo sunia koleba ine sulusu kuliba malesi gasiagufia moloba ado. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mad 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mag 9.35</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilimo auba moloba melabiyo. Inolo gili aleba wasolu miliyo hamesenaga, amo e inolo noolo sagoba ofa, balu ine dabalu moloba miliyo dobu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Aufia, inolo uleno gili aleba saminiba miliyo hamesenaga, amo e-mo gine <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolo</char> miliyo dobu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Mau enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> Eda iwi mulumo, idele inolo ilihe E sagoba homesine muluale. Aubale. Ehe ili sagoba ufiyone inigia, Ene miliyolu weasesia, idele inolo wedinale obegeba disia, su meyone mulu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe si kalalu inolo Badimisu waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Madiyu 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lugu 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ili Yeligo goalu. Aufia, Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, idele inolo wedinale ilida fuluba, dauno amo gadefia dedalesi, si kalalu inolo uleno, ene wi <char style="sls">Badimisu</char>, Dimisune faibe, e eno aniba ami yoba asulu. E ami sigia, idele inolofea mole memaba haaliba ado.<verse eid="MRK 10:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ehe Nasalede inolo Yesu saabeba solumo dofasia, e koleba wesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibe, Yesu, Ga na yagunagama-aaa!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ausi, inolo wedinalehe efea halalesia, saumaba solu. Auba soluso, ehe haiba koleba wuaasia, “Deibidine faibe, Ga na yagunagama-aaa!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu e selefemo dofasia, kalugaafia selesia, “E iwi milama!” Auba selesi, ilihe si kalalu amofea selesia, “Ge asigi kolefasia, ga degema. E ga milafe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Auba selesi dofasia, Badimisu e ene fagulo saligalumo huba dafasia, alebale degefasia, Yesu labea daalu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea doba bisigia, “Na gafea amene molomesi hamefe?” Si kalalu amohe Efea selesia, “Walelo, na haiba bebeleyo hamefe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:34">Mag 5.34</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ge <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule Nafea ufulu</char> ogohe ga waifegulu, ga malale.” Auba selesi, alebale hamagi, ene simo waifasia, e bebelelabia, Yesuda aafea eno aiba amo kuliba daalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Blind Batimias healed" file="C080.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="10.46-52">Yesuhe si kalalu inolo Badimisu waiba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu E kinigulu alefasia Yelusalame huga daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Madiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lugu 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yone 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1-2" />Ili auba abia, Yelusalame goayo hagoaleba adesi, Olifi galea Bedefage mosomiada, Bedani mosomiada, goalu. Ami goafia, Yesuhe <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> aida nomo malasia, aalufea selesia, “Aali mosomu nini bosolu anogo, mala. Mosomu ami goasiamo, aali <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> kalofo uleno kiliselu dobi babiyobafe. Dofene dogi amomo, inoloda aso aselale. Kiliselu dobu amo fisigafia, iwi ulubia milale. <verse eid="MRK 11:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Inolo ulenohe, ‘Aali ogo ene moloseba’ wanesenaga, amo eweguba obegeba saamale. ‘<char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> ewefea dabalu moloyo dobugulu, molofasia, alebale ulubia obegeyobafe.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Yesu aalufea auba selesi, aalumo abia, dofene dogi kalofomo eno kia, molo ule aniba kiliseba dobi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Aalu dofene dogi kiliselu amo fisigaba labi, inolo noolo aniba ami alolu amo, aalufea doba bisigia, “Wae! Aali ene moloyone dogi ogo fisigase?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Aaluhe Yesu sulu soluguba saaba mesi, ilihe waagi fisigafia malalu. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ausi, aaluhe dofene dogi amo Yesu labea ulubia milifasia, aine fagulo dogi saabia feaba ofelesi, E ami felafia asulu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Auba ausi, inolo wedinale ami alebailumo, ine fagulo sesela hufasia, eno aiba fefeaba waalesi, noolo samia walu gegelefia, eno aiba fefealu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Sng 118.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 148:1">148.1</ref></char></note>Noolo dufia, noolo saminiba, dedaleba ligia, wuaaba wabialeba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">“Hosana!</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Hosana</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ba sulu sodo amone sisa: “Ene wi wabialemaba” selefe.</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Inolo ewe Godene wi saabia mulugulu,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Efea wabialesia, wi digima-aaa!</char><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />
    <char style="qt">Nine nauwa <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidihe</char> yasifia luba adomo saabego-ooo!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Amone wabialesia, wi digima-aaa!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Hosana! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Ana Labe Lagone wi digima-aaa!”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu E Yelusalame goafia, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu sugafia, Ehe kegele usu ami dobumo sunia bebelelu. Nigiliyo hagoalesi, E Ene faibili hugulubamodai Bedani obegeba daalu.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe olono ifea sebe helemabiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Madiyu 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Adigi keafamo, ili Bedani gadefia miliba ligia, Yesu mamialu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:6">Lug 13.6</ref></char></note>E mamiaba daaba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono i</char> uleno walu nafulufia, hago labi abulu. Baafia, olono amohe sebe helebulaba, i mau maiya bea daalu. E i mau maiya ami goasia bisigia, i amo walu balusu labi abulu. Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono sebe</char> helelo giale. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />I amo sebe heleluale baafia, Yesuhe i amofea selesia, “Ge sebemo, inolo uleno saabia no namenesiale helemabiyo!” Auba selesimo, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili amo dubulu.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sebele molo yalaiya ami, kegeleda elegelo inolomo aiba gasaba yaalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Madiyu 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lugu 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yone 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ili Yelusalame goafia, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yalaiya ami sugafia, moleda bedoba adone ailalumoda, haga hiluda elegelone ailalumoda, besigaba dafalisia, inolo kegeleda elegesia waalelumo aiba gasaba dafalilu. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Aufia, Ehe ilifea sebele molo yalaiya usu elegeyone kegele sefasia waagi milabiyolu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ais 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7.11</ref></char></note>E auba molofia, ilifea waleba selesia, “Doma! Eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Ne molo ewe helefealu idele inolo suniahe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ado molo miliyobafe.</char> Auluso, gili alefasia, molo ewe fadilo inolone muguba ado hele gadefalubu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mag 14.1</ref></char></note>Yesuhe walelumo, idele inolo gagaiyolumo momoleba dubulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ilimo Yesufea haboba hilisesia, sagiliba abulu. Auba ligia, ilihe E dufiyone eno isalu. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Geide adesi, Yesuda ili Yelusalame afasia daalu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufuluhe Godedai sulu selesenaga, e kegele diyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Madiyu 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Adigi keafale koleba, Yesuda ili obegeba abia, bosolufalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono imo</char>, waluda, semeda, sunia bausolu labi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Yesu sulu solumo obegeba asigifia alolugulu, olono i bausolumo baafia, Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, aide Ga olono i ewefea kaoba selesomo, aga bausoba dulu labe amo, Ga bama.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gili Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homale</char>. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mad 17.20</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, gilihe asigi aidafia ligiale, kegele seale holobagamesi <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofasia</char>, hele gale ewefea, ‘Ga gene meleba olaboba abia, waiyo galulu ilogo dafogomaba’ selesenaga, hele gale amo gili selefeguba, auba moloyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mad 7.7</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ga Godefea kegele uleno memesifia haalilumo, ga ama dulu loluba asigi ule ofelesenaga, amo seale diyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25-26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mad 6.14-15</ref></char></note>Aufia, ga degeba ligia, Godedai sulu selesiamo, Gao <char style="w">Hebene</char> labe lagohe, ge wolumo hamasia heefasia galimesine, gada inolo noolofea gogoloba hiliselumo, ine wolumoda <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galimale</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ga kiwi dulu ogo, abehe wi mesoba, ilihe Yesufea doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Madiyu 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lugu 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Aufia, ili saabia Yelusalame goafiamo, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu siba labimo, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inoloda, asidalu inoloda, ili sunia Yesu labea milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ili ami milibaifasia, Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Kegele ga molofe ogo, moloyone wida solu kiwigagalu ogo, wagifia dulu? Abehe Gafea wabialelo wi mesi, Ga auba molose?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Nada gilifea sulu no doba babiyobasu. Gilihe Nafea obegeba selesenaga, amo Nahe wida solu halane alefasia, Na kegele ewe molosuba gilifea saaba meyo.” <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Auba saafia, Yesuhe ilifea doba bisigia, “<char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalelu amomo, e mana ewe wagifia dulu? <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenefia</char> molomasi mololula, me inolone hilise alefasia mololula? Nafea obegeba saama.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Auba doba besabi, ilihe ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Nini selesia, ‘Hebenefia molomasi, mololuba’ selesenaga, amo E ninifea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Gili sulu e selefemo sigidubuluale ogo, mau enesi ause?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Auluso, ninihe selesia, ‘Helefealu inolohe e malasi, muluba’ selesenaga, ...” Ili sulu amo saeyodoluale. Enebamo, idele inolohe Yonemo seale <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inoloba hiliselugulu, ilimo idele inolo baaba sagililu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Aulugulu, ilihe Yesufea obegeba selesia, “Nini babeafe.” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Amo, Nahe wi halagulu alefasia, dabalu molosuba gilifeada saeyale.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo wolu noolo waini gelu yasilomone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Madiyu 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lugu 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Ais 5.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe guni inolo ili amofea besi sulu eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe ene geiya ami <char style="w">waini</char> edo geba waalefia, gelu amo yalalu. Aufasia, ehe waini sebeda fasilo gogolu ami diba ufulu. Aufia, geiya ami sidafia yasifia melesine, ehe molo ana diba ufulu. Aufia, ehe gelu amo yasifia luba melesine, inolo noolo gadefalu. Aufia, e-mo hele hago daalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Sebe suiyo hilia adesimo, geluda biso ehe, waini sebe sulu amone haisi dia milesine, <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibe</char> uleno gelu yasiba ado ili labea ami malalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Auluso, dabalu mololo faibe amo ami goasi, geluda yasiba ado ili amohe, e dufa sodofia, e sone balu obegeba malalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Aufia, geluda bisohe dabalu moloba ofolo no ili labea hilibaisi, ilihe inolo amo gunia yaminifia, naga mesia, wobasubale yuaba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Aufia, ehe noda saabia malaluso, ilihe inolo amo dufa olalu. Aufia, bisohe, inolo wedinale noolo saabia hilibaisaluso, ilihe noolomo balu yaminiba yaasia, noolomo dufa danelu.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Auba ausi, geluda bisomo, faibe ule, ene yaguso, aso labe. Dufia kadafelesia, e ene faibe amo ili labea malasia, ene eweguba solu. ‘Ne faibe koleba e-mo, ilihe e baaba momolesia, ene sulu dubiyobafe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Auluso, geluda yasiba ado ilihe, ene faibe saabe baafia, ili nenesia selesia, ‘Inolo ewehe, enaone daalo sunia diyobafe. Mila, nini e dufa olasia, ene daalomo nini diyoba.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:12">Hib 13.12</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ilihe e sefasia, dufa olafasia, ene domalamo waini gelumone egeisialo saidafulu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Besi sulu auba saaba samodosia, Yesu selesia, “Gili eneba hilisefe, waini geluda bisomohe, eneba moloyobafe? E milifasiamo, geluda yasiba ado ili amo yasoba dafalifia, waini gelu amo inolo noolofea meyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sng 118.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:42">Mad 21.42</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:11">1Kld 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref></char></note>Gilihe sulu selelu dobu ogo alegalualela? Sulu amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">Abanemo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">moloda dilo ilihe wolubusia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">waaselaba abulu amo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">Aga abane amomo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">moloda kiwigaaba sefia melesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">duguiya ikau olaibo gadefalu labe.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w">Saminilo</char> alefasia auba molosimo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="qt">nine sihe momolelu bule koleba bosolu. ”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Yesu besi sulu amo selefe dofasia, guni inolo ilihe E seyone eno isalu. Maumo, ili hilisesia, Ehe besi sulu amo selesia, ine ili iminiba solububa hiliselu. Auluso, ilimo idele inolo gagaiyolu amo baaba sagilisia, E sebale afa daalu.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomene kini Sisafea mole meyo nafulubileba doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Madiyu 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lugu 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 11:53-54">Lug 11.53-54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dufia, guni inolo ili amohe <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo nooloda, Helodo galiba ado nooloda, ili Yesu labea malalu. Ilihe Yesu gegesia, sulu Ene selefe amo E semesifia, ili malalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ili E labea goasiamo selesia, “Walelo, nini hilisesia, inolo seale sodomo Ga-ba hilisesu. Aufia, Ga seale sulu sodo amosu kuliba abia, Godene manamo idele inolofea walelo. Gahe inolo noolo sulu selefe baaba sagililalegulu, Ga sulu suniafea selesiamo, inolo widafeada, widalefeada, imini uluse sodo. Aulugulu, Ga eneba hilisebu? Ninihe dagese mole Lomene kini <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisafea</char> waagi ufiyo isolubile, me isolualebile? Ninihe efea dagese mole meyobile, me meyalebile? Ga eneba selese?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Auba doba besabi, Yesuhe ili masega gegeyone selefe amo baafia, ilifea eweguba doba abulu. “Gilihe na kani walemesi helese ogo, mau ene? Lome gamanene mole iso uleno Na babiyone iwi dibia mila.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Auba selesi, ilihe mole iso amo Yesu bamesi mesi, Ehe ilifea doba bisigia, “Mole ewene saabiamo, abene mimisililu labebu? Aufia, mole saabia, wi selelu dobu ogo, abenebu?” Auba doba besabi, ili obegeba selesiamo, “Sisanebuba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:7">Lom 13.7</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Sisanemo, Sisafea mema. Godenemo, Godefea mema.” Auba selesi, ili E baaba hidigifia, momoleba hiliselu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadiyusi ilihe inolo olafia haiba degelomone Yesudai sulu hegelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Madiyu 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lugu 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">HD 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> inolo noolo Yesu labea milibailu. Sadiyusi mosomu ili amomo, inolo danelumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> gaalaleba sodo. Inolo ili amohe Yesufea selesia, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Lo 25.5</ref></char></note>“Walelo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> nineba eweguba seleba ufulu. <char style="qt">‘Inolo uleno e ido difasia, faibeda male ligia olasenaga, amo ene elewohe ido ilisulu amo difasia, ene elewo olalumone mosomu amo mimilosifia, faibe seba gaeyobafe.’</char> Mosesehe auba molomalelu. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Aulugulu, doma. Hilia uleno, elewodali domoba asulu. Olaibomohe ido difasia, e faibeda male ligia, olalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ido ilisulu amo, elewo olaibo faisa amo duluso, eda faibeda male ligia, olasi, aufia haiba amone faisa, elewo osolo amo e duluso, amoda aubasu mololu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Elewo domoba amo ili sunia faibeda male ligia, olalabia aasimo, ido ule hamagane no diyo labia daalu. Aufia, ili sunia faibeda male daneba samodosi, kaaba dafelesiamo, ido amoda olalu. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Elewodali domoba amohe ido ule hamagane dulugulu, danelu ili amo seale haiba degeba gaasenaga, ido amo abene eamono koleba miliyobafebi?” Sadiyusi ilihe Yesufea auba doba abulu.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ili auba doba besabi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Godene sulu selelu dobumoda, Godene kiwigagalumoda, gili fadaba asigibualegulu, gili sulu heleba babeaba selefe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Daneba yaalu haiba degesiamo, inolo ido diyobafale, ido inolo maiyobafale. Aubale. Ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">sulu dia ano</char> amogulu miliyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Kis 3.2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref></char></note>Aufia, inolo olafasia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelofealomone</char>, gili sulu Mosesene bugo usu selelu dobumo alegalualebile? I abobo de naafea aleba ami, Godehe Mosesefea eweguba solu, <char style="qt">‘<char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> Godeda, Aisegene Godeda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> Godeda, Na loluba’ solu.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Gode E daneba yaalune Gode-ale. Aubale. E bebea alebaibumone Gode. Aulugulu, gilihe inolo olalu degeyobafaleba asigife ogo, amo gili heleba babeaba asigife.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molomalelu sulu wasolu bule kolebamo ewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Madiyu 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lugu 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lug 10.25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ulenohe, Sadiyusi ili Yesu galiba hegeba labi dubulu. Yesu sulu nafulusu ilifea obegeba selefe amo eloba bafasia, e Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Godene bugo usu molomalelu sulu wedinale selelu dobuso, amone aleba ami, halane wasolu bule koleba?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Lo 6.4-5</ref></char></note>Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Molomalelu sulu wasolu bule kolebamo ewe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:29" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:29">
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo, nafuluba doma.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:29">
    <char style="qt">Saminilo, nine Gode, E ule koleba labe.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, gili koleba, Saminilo, nine Gode, Efea hamesesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:30">
    <char style="qt">gine libo kolebada, gine asubane kolebada, gine asigi kolebada,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:30">
    <char style="qt">aufia gine kiwi kolebada Efea hamesemale.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, molomalelu sulu aganebo solu dobumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:31" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:31">
    <char style="qt">Gahe gene meleba hameselo amogubasu, ge damene noolo anogoda auba hamesemale.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:31" />
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:31">Molomalelu sulu aida ewene suniaba wasolu bule no male.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Lo 6.4</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, inolo amo Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, Ga sulu seale selefe. <char style="qt">Gode E koleba ule labeba, selefe ogomo, seale koleba selefegulu, Gode no male.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:22">1Sml 15.22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref></char></note><char style="qt">Hamesesiamo, nine libo kolebada, nine asigi kolebada, aufia nine kiwi kolebada Efea hamesesia, ge damene noolo anogoda, ga gene meleba hameseloguba hameseyo amomo, kelebulu soba melomoda, Godefea ulu melomoda suniaba wasolu dobu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Inolo amo sulu auba obegeba solumo, inolo asigida ufulu sodoguba selefe baafia, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Ga Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami hagoaleba labe.” Auba selesi, inolo suniahe sagilisia, saabia no Efea doba abuluale.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deibidihe ene enauwafea ne Saminiloba enesi solubi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Madiyu 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lugu 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> yalaiya ami, Godene sulu mana waleba ligia, Ehe ilifea eweguba doba abulu. “<char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilihe selesia, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibeba solu ogo, enesi auba solubi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> Deibidifea asigilo mesi, e selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:36" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">‘Saminilo Ehe, ne Saminilofea eweguba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">Ga ne sone lilibefealo yoba aselesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">Nahe ge gisa inolomo ge emo sisa waalemesi yasiba mela.’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Gili bama. Deibidihe Kelisofea, Ga ne Saminiloba selesenaga, Keliso E halaguba Deibidine faibe miliyobafebi?” Auba doba besabi, idele inolo bule gagaiyolu ili amohe, Yesu sulu solumo heneba dubulu.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe muguli manane dawalolu inolo ilifea haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Madiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Lugu 11.37-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea walesia eweguba solu. “Gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane walelo inolo</char> ili nafuluba yasimale. Enebamo, ilihe fagulo sesela siligaba nafulusu kakafia, gagaiyola helea ami, idele inolo ilidale wakalimesisia, misi waleba siyo hamelo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu aselesiamoda, wida solu molobu amisu kakainayo hamelo. Aufia, naiyo bule naiyone gagaiyosiamo, ili wida solumone molobu saabia kakainayo hamelo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ilihe idele ilisulu nafuluba uluba adesiale, ine mole kegeleda ilifea meba yaamesisia, gegeba ado. Aufia, ili Godedai sulu selesiamo, masega selale domadomaba koleba sodo. Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, naga inolo amogulumo diyobafe amohe, inolo no naga diyobafemo waseyobafe”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ido ilisuluhe mole e ufuluguba Godefea melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lugu 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Aufia, Yesu E sebele molo yala usu ligia, moleda dafogolo bogose baaba anogoba ami yoba saabihe, idele inolo wamilimo inigia, ine ulu molemo bogose usu ami dafaliba ilogosi sidafia alolu. Elebeda ufulu inolo wedinalehe mole bule dafogosi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Aufia, ido ilisulu uleno e weagulu labegulu, mole iso wedino aida dafogosi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:12">2Kld 8.12</ref></char></note>Aufe baafia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> milafia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu. Ido ilisulu weagulu ewehe, mole wedino dafogosomo, idele inolo noolo mole bogose usu dafogolumo, suniaba bule dafogofe. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Enebamo, idele inolo sunia mole dafogosiamo, ine mole selo gofo wasigafia, huliane galeba dalelu haisi difasia dafogoso. Auluso, ido ilisulu ogohe, ene mole naiyo elegeyone sobo ufulumo sunia dafogoso.” <figure style="fig" alt="Poor widow tithes" file="IB04114.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="12.41-44">Ido ilisuluhe mole e ufuluguba Godefea mefe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sebele molo woyobafeba saaba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Madiyu 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lugu 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> gadefia aasi, Ene <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> ulenohe selesia, “Walelo, molo yogolelusu diaba yaalu eweda, abane nafulusu yalalu eweda, Ga besela?” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:44">Lug 19.44</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Ga abane molo bule dulu ewe bisigiamo, yogolelububa besabela? Dufia, molo ewe olaboba dafaliba yaasimo, hodobaisasia, abane suniamo, no no saabia sesagulaba diba ufulu dobu amogulu miliyobafale.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higinilu wedinale holobagagaeyobafe amone saaba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Madiyu 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lugu 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ili Yelusalame afasia, Olifi galea felafia, <char style="w">sebele molo</char> baaba anogofia yoba sigia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduluda</char>, ilibisu Yesu labea milifasia ligia, Yesufea eweguba doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Ga auba selesomo, hilia asiga moloyobafebi, ninifea saaba mema. Hilia amo wakaliba sugaeyone hagoale adefebamo, nini eneba eloba babiyobi? Ga ninifea walema.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe gili gegesia, heleba luba dia anosi, gili nafuluba yasimale. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Enebamo, inolo wedinale milibaifia, Ne wi saaba selesia, ‘Na-mo, E loluba’ gegesia, idele inolo wedinale heleba luba dia dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Gilihe sulu gi dobelesia, yobofeba solu dubiyobafe. Aufia, ili yobofe galada, gili dubiyobafe. Amo nafuluba, gili hidigifia sagilimabiyo. Kegele amo moloyobafeso, aleba eloyo hilia aso. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Hele nolobalo idele inolohe, hele nolobalodai gisa diaba yaeyobafe. Kini yasiba ado nohe, kini yasilo nodai yoboyobafe. Aufia, hele nolobalomo heleli sigiyobafe, aufia mamia gi bule holobagaeyobafe. Kegele amo sunia, idohe faibe haseyone maugaba naga bologuba besabe.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mad 10.17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba ausimo, gili gine meleba nafuluba yasiba melale. Ilihe gilimo uluba dibia abia, ine galisolofea godosia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu efolo fegoyobafe. Ne wi gilifea dobugo alefasia, ilihe gili kinidai, gamanedai, si saabia degeba melasi, gilihe asigi ule ufulu ogone mau ilifea saeyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Awalu sulu nafulumo, helefealu idele inolo suniafeadale samini saaba meba samodoyo dobu. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lug 12.11-12</ref></char></note>Gili godomesi sefia uluba dibia, aso wanebale labimo, gili sagiliba hilisesia, nini sulu halaguba saeyobiba keleba hilisemabiyo. Enebamo, fogo hamagi koleba, suluda saeyobafe amo, giliale. Aubale. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> Ene E sulu saeyobafe. Aulugulu, sulu Ehe asigiba ofelefe amosu, gili saamale. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:21">Mad 10.21</ref></char></note>Hilia amoyamo, elewohe ene elewomo dufa olamesi holonoyobafe. Ausi, enaohe ene faibefea aubasu moloyobafe. Ausi, faibilihe elelisia, enaodai enaedaifea gisa adesia, aalu dumesi, noolone sone saabia ufiyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mad 10.22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:21">Yon 15.21</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ne wi gilifea dobugo alefasia, inolo suniahe gilifea gogoloba babiyobafe. Auluso, idele inolo kiwigagaba kalugalabia abia, aleba elofefea elofe ili amo, siba dafaliyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kegele wolune wolu koleba holobagaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Madiyu 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lugu 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref></char>
    </note>“Gilihe <char style="qt">kegele kalemolu wolu koleba, woba dafiyone kegelemo,</char> melabiyoba soiya ami labi besenaga, amo Yudia helea alebaibu gili amo, hele galea ami fisaba dedalemale. Inolo sulu eweda alegafemo, nafuluba asigiba dimale. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lug 17.31</ref></char></note>Aufia, inolo molo saabia lagi labemo, e ene kegele molo usu dobumo diyone, huga abiale, fisaba malale. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Aufia, inolo edo geiya labemo, ene fagulo selale diyone, moloa obegeba abiale, fisaba malale. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:29">Lug 23.29</ref></char></note>Hilia fogo amo, idele faibeda kakainabumoda, enaedali faibefea bu meba yaafemoda, ili amofea yeele! Yagunagalu bule. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Aufia, kegele amo kene gia badilu labi holobagamesiale, gili Godedai sulu saamale. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">MUU 7.14</ref></char></note>Maumo, hilia amoyamo, higinilu bule koleba babiyobafe. Godehe helefealu maugaba hili moloiya amifia, inigia, aga labea iwi, higinilu amoguluda samini abuluale. Dufiada, higinilu amogulu haiba no babiyobafale.<verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Godehe hilia amo aboboba ufulualebiaga, amo idele inolo sunia siba dafaiyale. Auluso, Godehe idele inolo Ene-ba molobebelelu amone hilisesia, hilia amo aboboba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Aufia, hilia amoyamo inolo ulenohe gilifea selesia, ‘Bama, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char> iwi labe’, me ‘Anigi labe bamaba’ selesenaga, amo gilihe sulu amo sigiba domabiyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:13">MUU 13.13</ref></char></note>Maumo, hilia amoyamo, masega kelisoda, masega saaba ofolo inoloda, wedinale holobagagafia, idele inolo gegemesine, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba wedinale moloyobafe. Ilihe auba moloba ligia, Godene molobebelelu idele inolomo, heleba luba dibia dedaleyo ilililubiaga, amo ili molobaiye. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Doma. Kegele ewe aso holobagabale labi, Na gilifea samini waagi saaba melu. Aulugulu, gili yasiba melale.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dufiamo Inololene Faibe miyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Madiyu 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lugu 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Higiniluda besabe fogo amo samodosi, hilia fogo ami, halo nigiligagasia, aubeda neeyobafale.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ais 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34.4</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="qt">Ausi, sigabimo anakiwi afasia, dogolobaisasi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="qt">anakiwi lagone kiwimoda bubuliba yaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:7">MUU 1.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Auba molosimo, idele inolo ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> kiwigagalu bule alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleludai</char> iwa aleba suga saabi babiyobafe.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:41">Mad 13.41</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia amoyamo, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia ano</char> hele kulia biniba amida, anakiwi kulia amida, hilibaisafia, helefealu idele inolo Ene molobebelelumo sunia gagaiyoba waaleyone dedalemayobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu selesia, Gili olono ifea eloba bamaleba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Madiyu 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lugu 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono ifea</char> asigilo eweguba dimale. Olono i odo besegegenefia, komo gagasi besenaga, amo heleso gi hagoale adefebuba eloba bolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Amogubasu, gilihe higinilu kegele amo auba holobagagasi besenaga, gili hilisesiamo, E hagoale eno saliba mulu labebuba hilisemale. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Na seale gilifea selesu, idele inolo saladegelu aga kakainabu ewe, aso danebale alebaibi, kegele ewe sunia holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Helefealuda, anakiwida, asigileyobafe. Auluso, Ne sulu mana asigileyobafale.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kegele amo moloyobafemo inolo uleno hiliada halosida asigibuale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Madiyu 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Yesu saabia selesia, “Kegele amo asiga moloyobafebibamo, hiliada, halosida, inolo ulenoda asigibuale. <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> sulu dia ano ilida asigibuale, aufia Faibe Eneda asigibuale, Enao ule elebisu asigibu. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Aulugulu, gine asigi madenefia yasiba melale. Maumo, fogo halayago moloyobafebibamo gili asigibale labe. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Amo eweguba iminiba besi selesu. Moloda biso uleno e hele nolobalo sobele abiamo, ene molo yasiba melesine, ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo inolofea</char> wi mesia, dabalu molomesi waleba sagasia, enoda yasilo inolofea nafuluba yasiba melalelu.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:38">Lug 12.38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili nafuluba koleba yasimale. Moloda biso amo halayago miyobafebibamo, fogo gili asigibuale. E geide miyobafebile, me nigili dogolea miyobafebile, me gogono galasi miyobafebile, me keafa nigilibale miyobafebile, amo gili asigibuale. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />E solugo-ba saabale hidigiba daafa goasia, gili hanefia labi bolosi. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Sulu Na gilifea selesu ewe, idele inolo suniafeada saaba mesu. ‘Yasiba mela!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesu dufiyone sulu daiyaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Madiyu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lugu 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yone 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> maugaeyomone aso hilia aida dobi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ilihe Yesu gegefia, E dufa olaeyomone eno keleba isaba alolu. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Auba ligia, ili selesia, “Sigilo hilia aga ewe nini auba auyobale, maumo auba ausenaga, idele inolo nine geleba belaguyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ido ulenohe walea hano kasineda nokene koleba Yesune gunia sagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Madiyu 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yone 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Lug 7.37-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu E Bedani ami ligia, inolo Saimono samini yolida alolu amone moloa ami sigia, naiyo naba labi, ido uleno abane bodolo wedino yogoleluhe, walea hano kasineda, Yesu saabea dia suga mulu. Ido amohe bodolo dofoga dugufasia, walea hano amo Yesune guni saabia sagalu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Inolo ami kakainalumo, idomo molofemo bafasia, ilihe efea haboba hilisefia, ilibi nenesia selesia, “Ido ogo walea hano kasineda ewe enesi balu weasefebi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Walea hano ewe elegesiabiaga, hamu ulene dabalu molosi elebe dilo amogulu difasia, mole amo weagulu ilifea meyone diba ofaiye.” Auba hilisesia, ilihe ido amofea gadiba solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Ido ogo molofemo waagima. Gilihe efea habolu sulu samabu. E Nafeamo mana nafulu heafuba moloso. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Lo 15.11</ref></char></note> <char style="qt">Helefealu iwi, weagulu idele inolo ili amo, hilia sunia gili galiba miliyobafe.</char> Aulugulu, gilihe ili sagoba ufiyo hilise adefeguba, ami sagoba ofolabasu miliyone hilia fogo wedinale dobu. Auluso, Na-mo, hilia sunia gili galiba miliyobafale. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Yon 19.40</ref></char></note>Ido ewe kegele moloyo ufulugubamo, ama moloba samodoso. E walea hano Na domala sagasomo, Ne domala dana usu diba ufiyomone madenesia auso. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Aulugulu, Na sulu ewe gilifea seale koleba selesu. Awalu Sulu Nafulu helefealu sunia walelabia sifea ami, idele inolo suniahe ido ewe auba mololuba asigimesine, selabia daabasu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu yasilo inolofea holonoba meyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Madiyu 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lugu 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodo</char>, faibe hugulubamo no e, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melomone guni inolo</char> ilifea Yesumo holonoba meyone daalu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ili labea goafia, auba selesi, ili nokene henefasia, ilihe mole efea meyoba saaba ufulu. Fogo amifia, Yudasahe E-mo ine sone saabia ufiyone eno keleba isaba alolu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Ene walelu faibilidai naiyo mololu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Madiyu 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lugu 22.7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yone 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:6">Kis 12.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo</char> amone hilia agele adesi, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe dofene sibi dufasia soba melo. Hilia amoyamo, Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe Efea wanesia selesia, “<char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> naiyo naiyone, ninihe wagi daafia, madeneba ufiyobiba” doba abulu.<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibe aida nomo malalesia, aalufea eweguba solu. “Aali sidi usu ami sugamale. Sugasimo, inolo uleno hano gofo wasulu uleno digifia, miliba labi, aali wakaliyobafe. Aali e kuliba malale. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Molo eda sugafea ami sugamale. Ausi, aalihe molo amone enaofea eweguba saamale. ‘Walelohe gafea doba bisigia, Nada, Ne walelu faibili galiba, Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone naiyo naba misiyomone, lalolu amo wagi dobuba doba besabeo.’ Aali efea auba doba bamale. <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Aufia, ehe aalifea lalolu ana lagi, kegeleda sunia madeneba dobia ami, waleyobafe. Aali lalolu ami, nini ua naiyo naba misiyomone madeneba homale.” Auba safasia, Yesuhe aalu malalu. <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ausi, aalu abia, bosolufalumo, kegele sunia Yesuhe aalufea soluguba, sunia moloba samodolu dobi baafia, aaluhe Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone naiyo amo ami madenelu.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Aalu ami naiyo madenefia labi, geidesi, Yesuda, inolo hugulubamo ilida, moloa ami goalu. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sng 41.9</ref></char></note>Ili ami sigia, naiyo naba ligia, Yesu selesia, “Sulu ewe gilifea seale koleba selesu. Gili aga Nadai naiyo naafe ewe, ulenohe Na holonoyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Yesu sulu selefe amo dofasia, ine asigi higinifia, ili ule ulebahe Yesufea doba bebelesia, “Ogo na dagulo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ili auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili huguluba aleba ami, Nadai iwi fofo ule naiyo diyone sone sugafe, amo e. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, e saaba sulu selelu dobuguba, olaeyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe Inololene Faibemo gisa inolofea holonoba seba mefe amo, yeele, efea woba ufiyobafe. Enae e seba dulualebiaga, amo e nafulubaiye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Yesuhe boledidai, waini sebe hanodai, Ene walelu faibilifea namenesi melu</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Madiyu 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Lugu 22.15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolidi 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ili naiyo naba ligia, Yesuhe <char style="w">boledi</char> difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, Ene walelu faibilifea gogoleba sagasia, selesia, “Ewe Ne domala, gili difasia, namena.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Aufia, Ehe waini hano gaabu wasulu difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, ilifea namenesi melu. Ili ami kakainalumo sunia gaabu amo difasia, hano nabailu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kis 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:11">Sek 9.11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:16">1Kld 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:20">Hib 9.20</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Waini hano aga gili naafe ogo, Ne ibi. Ne ibi ewehe, idele inolo wedinale sagoba ufiyomone, <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">oloba huliale sulu</char> hagaea amone iminisia, sagaeyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Na gilifea selesu, Na <char style="w">waini</char> hano saabia no nabale ligiasu, hilia Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami ligia, hili nabiamo naiyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ili naiyo amo naba samodosiamo, Godene wi digisia, gasa saafia, ili degeba yaafia, hele gale Olibifealomo dedalelu.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesu bolaleba saeyobafeba Yesuhe auba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Madiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lugu 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yone 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sek 13.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Gili asigi ule ufulumo sunia gelebaisaba yaeyobafe. Enebamo, saaba ofelesia eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 14:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="qt">Gode eweguba selefe. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="qt">‘Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi">dofene sibida</char> luba adomo dufelesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="qt">dofene sibi fisaba dedaleba yaeyobafe.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mad 28.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:7">Mag 16.7</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, Na <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefasiamo</char>, Galili helea ami Nadale samini maiyobasu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Yesuhe selefemo dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> obegeba selesia, “Ili sunia gelebaisasenaga, na aubada gelebaiyale koleba!” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mag 14.66-72</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe Fidafea selesia, “Aga nigiliba iwi, gogono aidaba aso galaluale labi, ga koleba Na waaselaba bisigia, Na bolaleba mofebu osoloaba saeyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:16">Yon 11.16</ref></char></note>Auluso, Fidahe Efea koleba selesia, “Na Gadai olaeyodolunaga amoda hama, na-mo Ga bolaleba aubada saeyale.” E auba selesi, nooloda sulu aubasu solu.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Gesemani geiya Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Madiyu 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lugu 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 18:1">Yon 18.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili hele Gesemaniba selefea ami goafia, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Na Godedai sulu selaba miliyo aasu, gili yagi mesale.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Auba safasia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, ilisu uluba dibia daalu. Daaba ligia, Ene libo higinifia, keleba hilisefia selesia, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:27">Yon 12.27</ref></char></note>“Na libo bule higinisia, olaeyo adefegulu, gili yagi sigia, si kolafia yasiba melale.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />E aso aleba asogofia, helea sauba hanefia ligia, higinilu amohe E suniaeyodolunaga, amo suniamesifia Godedai sulu eweguba solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mag 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:38">Yon 6.38</ref></char></note>“<char style="sls">Aba</char>, Nao-ooo, Ga kegele sunia moloyo ililibu. Gaabu naga wasulu Nafea namenesi dobu ewe, diba damale. Auluso, Na hamefegubale, Ga hamefegubasu molomale.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Auba saafia obegeba inigia, bosolufalumo, Ene walelu faibilimo hanefia labi bisigia, E Fidafea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ga hanefia elela? Ga halosi ule si kolafia ligia, Nadai yasiyodolualebula? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Dedeba babiyo holobagasi, gili gelebailosine, enogele ligia, Godedai sulu selaba melale. Seale, asubanemo moloyo hilisefeso, domalamo kiwidale adefe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Auba saaba mefasia, Yesu E saabia aleba asogofia, Godedai sulu samini soluguba hamaguba solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Aufia, E obegeba inigia, bosolufalumo, ili si hanemialugulu, saabia hanefia labi abulu. Yesuhe ili gilasimo, ili sulu obegeba saeyomo babealu. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ehe Godedai sulu osolomone saeyo daalu obegesia, ilifea selesia, “Gili aso hane gagalifia ligia, halemane esela? Hama! Halosi daiyaba ufulumo holobagafe. Bama, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> holonofia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololone</char> sone saabia ofelefe. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Degema, nini aasu, Nada holonoyomo, e saabe ewe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu holonofia gisa inolofea seba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Madiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lugu 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yone 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu E auba selaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char>, faibe hugulubamone uleno e, ami goalu. Inolo wedinale helebesida, digaluda, sesaifia milibailumo, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, guni inoloda, ili hilibaisasi, ili Yudasa galiba milibailu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Holonoba melo inolohe, gisa inolofea samini eweguba eloba bamalelu. “Na daafia, inolo nahe mimifemo, amo E. Gili koleba E sefia gasiba dibia malale.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Auba solugulu goasiamo, Yudasa edale alebale Yesu labea goasia, selesia, “Walelo!” Auba saafia, mimilu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ausi, ilihe Yesu fafuafia selu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ausi, inolo uleno E aniba alolumohe, helebesi selale sigiba difasia, soba melone yasilo amone <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo uleno</char> dufelesia, ene koneni geleba dafogolu.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu ilifea doba bisigia, “Gili helebesida, digaluda, sesaifia milibaisego, Na fadilo labebuba hilisesela? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lug 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:20">Yon 18.20</ref></char></note>Hilia sunia Na <char style="w">sebele molo</char> yalaiya ami waleba labimo, gilihe Na sesale. Auluso, Godene Bugo solu dobuguba wakaliba hugasia aufe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:11">Sng 31.11</ref></char></note>Ausi, walelu faibili sunia E gadefia fisaba dedalelu.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo fisamili uleno fisaba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51-52" />Aufia, inolo fisamili uleno fagulo gasiagufia, Yesuda ili faisa daaba labi, gisa inolohe eda seyo weiyaasi, ene fagulo amosu huba disia, e abagudoa fisaba daalu.<verse eid="MRK 14:51-52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu lubia galisolo si saabia godolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Madiyu 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lugu 22.54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yone 18.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ilihe Yesu sefasia, lubia abia, soba melomone yasilo inolo moloa daalu. Yesu ami lubia goasi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, asidaluda, ili ami gagaiyofia kakainalu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Ilihe Yesu lubia aasi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> eda E faisa faisaba abia, soba melone yasilo amone moloa goafia, yala usu sugalu. Sugafasia, e-mo sebele molone ibolo selu inolo amo galiba yoba sigia, de ninaba asulu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus led to High Priest" file="IB04157.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="14.53">Ilihe Yesu galisolone si saabia godoyosia lubia aafe.</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Molo usu ami, soba melone guni inoloda, galisolo inoloda, Yesu dufa olaeyone godoyosia, wolu E mololumo si abuluba saamesine, olofa inolo isalu. Ili isaluso, Yesu E wolu mololu uleno abuluale. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ilihe Yesu mololualemo masega egedidiba wedinale soluso, ili solu amodai ua iminiluale. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Aufia, inolo noolo degeba alebaifia, Yesu mololualemo masega bobaba eweguba solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19-21">Yon 2.19-21</ref></char></note>“Yesuhe eweguba selesi, nini dubulu. Sulu amo E selesomo ewe, ‘<char style="w">Sebele molo</char> inolo sone dulu ewe, Na bidiba dafasia, hilia osoloa alefasia, Na hili no saabia diyomo, inolo sone dulu amogubale, diyobasu.’ Yesu auba selesoba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Auluso, sulu ili solu amoda, elawaneba gagafia, sulu ili solumo iminiluale.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Aufia, soba melone yasilo inolomo ehe ili suniane olegia degefia selesia, “Yesu Gafea doba besabe ogo, Ga ilifea obegeba saeyalebula?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Auba doba besabi, Yesu E saufia ligia, sulu obegeba soluale. Aufia, soba melone yasilo inolohe Yesufea saabia doba bisigia, “Gode Iminifia Molobebelelumo, <char style="w">Keliso</char>, Ga-la? Isolaele Wabialelomone Faibemo, Ga-la? Na Gafea doba bosolu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Amo Na. <char style="qt">Gilihe <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo Kiwigagalu Amone sone lilibefealo yoba asefia, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> iwa saabia alefasia, saabi babiyobafe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Yesu E auba selefe dofasia, soba melone yasilo inolo e kanosia, ene fagulo kaalumo gagalaba dafasia selesia, “Olofa inolo noolo, nini aso eneyone isaeyo? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Wkp 24.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:7">Yon 19.7</ref></char></note>E Godegulu loluba selefe ogo, Ehe samabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe. Nini dubulugulu, gilihe Efea eneba moloyoba hilisefe?” Ausi, ili sunia selesia, “E selefe amo heleba mololububasi, E olaeyo dobu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Auba saafia, inolo noolohe Ene si hagufia, gau fodosia, sone musu naga sodoba yaminisia selesia, “Saaba ofolo Ga, inolo Gada dufelefe ogo wi abe? Gene saaba ofa saama!” Aufasia ami, ibolo selu inolo ilihe E gasiba sefia, sone dowelu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fida e Yesu bolaleba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Madiyu 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lugu 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yone 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ili Yesumo molo usu godoba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e molo amone yala usu iligi ligia, de ninaba yoba asulu. Auba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone</char> dabalu mololo ido uleno mulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ido amo e si galiba sidafia selesia, “Ga wagada Nasalede inolo Yesu lagodai adomo, ga-bu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Auba selesi, Fida selesia, “Sulu ga selefe ogo, na hilisebuale kolebaba” solu. Aufia, e aleba asogofia, eno anibafealo miliyo daalu. Ausi, gogono galalu.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Dabalu mololo ido amohe Fida ami aso labe baafia, inolo aniba ami labefea selesia, “Inolo ogo Yesudai silomo, no e-buba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Fidahe saabia selesia, “Ogo naaleba” solu. Wedino aso alefasia, Fida edai aniba alolu inolo noolomo selesia, “Ga koleba Galili inolobu. Ga seale Yesudai siba adomo, no ga-buba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Fidahe <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba selesia</char>, “Seale koleba, inolo gili selefe ogo na bolale. Na seale selesalenaga, amo Gode na woba ufiyobafe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.72 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:30">Mag 14.30</ref></char></note>Fida e auba saabagosi, alebale gogono saabia aganebo galalu. Gogono galasi, Fidahe Yesu sulu samini saaba ofelesomo ami hiliselu. “Gogono aidaba aso galabale labi, ga Na bolaleba mofebu osoloaba saeyobafe.” Sulu amone hilisesia, Fida e ami bule yeelu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu Filadusu labea lubia daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Madiyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lugu 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yone 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:66">Lug 22.66</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Keafa nigilibale, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, asidaluda, galisolo inolo ili suniada, sulu neneba labeofia, ami alebale sulu ule ufulu. Aufasia, ilihe Yesu dofafia, ulubia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusufea</char> seba melu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Ausi, Filadusuhe Yesufea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomune kinimo, seale Ga-la?” Yesu obegeba selesia, “Sulu amo, gene ga selefe waaga.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Soba melone guni inolo ilihe Yesufea fadaasia, oloba koweba sulu wedinale solu. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Ili auba selesi, Filadusuhe Yesufea selesia, “Ilihe sulu oloba koweba sulu wedinale Gafea selefe ogo, Ga obegeba saeyalebula?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ais 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:61">Mag 14.61</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yesuhe sulu obegeba selefale baafia, Filadusu e momoleba abulu.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filadusuhe Yesu imolane uluba homalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Madiyu 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lugu 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-19:16">Yone 18.38–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Sigilo hilia adesimo, Filadusuhe hamu sunia mana ewegubasu mololo. Dibolo dafalibagolu inolo ilimo, idele inolohe inolo amone sububa dafelagomaba selefeguba, sububa dafogolo. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Hilia amimo, inolo uleno dibolo asulu amone wi Balabasa, ehe gamane inolodai gisa diaba ligia, inolo dufa olalu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Aufia, idele inolohe Filadusufea e molologuba molomesifia, doba babiyo mulu.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> ilifea doba bisigia, “Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kini inolo ewe sububa dafelagomesiba asigifela?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Enebamo, Filadusuhe bisigia, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilihe, Yesu waaselaba bisigiane, E seba mefebuba eloba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:13-14">HD 3.13-14</ref></char></note>Auluso, soba melone guni inolo ilihe, idele inolone asigi degeba ofa selesia, Filadusufeamo Balabasa subu dafogomaba saamalu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Idele inolo auba selesi, Filadusu selesia, “Na auba molosenaga, inolo, gili Yudane kiniba selesego, na Efea eneba molomesi selese?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Auba doba besabi, ili wuaaba selesia, “Ogo <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba homa-aaa!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Auba selesi, Filadusuhe ilifea doba bisigia, “Enesi? E wolu amene mololubiyo?” Auluso, ili koleba wuaaba selesia, “E imolane uluba homaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Filadusuhe idele inolo henemesifia, Balabasamo ilifea sububa dafogosia, ene ibolo selu inolohe Yesu fegomesi gadefalu. Auba molofasia, E imolane uluba homesi, yobolo inolone sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibolo selu inolo ilihe Yesu baaba galulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Madiyu 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yone 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ilihe Yesu gamane molo amone lalolu no ami ulubia hugafia, ibolo selu sunia wafe dulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ilihe Yesu hegofia ligia, fagulo genelu Efea kaaba ofelesia, efolo aiye gagalu mabufasia, kinine habugagulu, Ene gunia saligaba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Aufia, ili Efea baaba gaidesia, selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kini, Ga! Keafa nafulu! Nini Ga wabialesu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Aufasia, ilihe solobo difasia, Yesune guni saabia doweba dafalisia, Efea gau fodolu. Ilihe E sisa emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, Ene wi masega wabialelu. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Auba moloba labeofia, fagulo genelu kaalumo huba ofasia, fagulo Enemone kaaba ofasia, E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufiyone baealo ulubia daalu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu imolane uluba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Madiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lugu 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yone 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Lom 16.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesumo ulubia daaba ligia, ilihe dauno Salini inolo uleno eno aiba miliba labi wakalifasia, Yesune <char style="w">imolane</char> efea digimesi egedidilu. Inolo amo Alegesadadai, Lufusudai, aine enaomo, ene wimo, Saimono. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Aufia, ilihe Yesu ulubia abia, hele <char style="sls">Gologoda</char>ba soiya ami goalu. <char style="sls">Gologoda</char> amone sulu kiwi sisamo Guni Kiwi Hele. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ami goafia, ilihe naga gelemesi <char style="w">waini</char> hanodai, mulumulo hanodai besifia, namenesi meluso, Yesu amo mololuale. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sng 22.18</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufulu. Imolane uluba ofasia, ibolo selu inolo ilihe, Yesune fagulo dugulumo osolasia, abe difelaba babiyosia sadu dailu.<figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers gamble at cross" file="C087.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="15.24">Yesu imolane uluba ufia labi, ibolo selu ilihe sadu daisi, guni inolohe E baaba gaidesi, Ene kuliba silo ili yegiliba labe.</figure> <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Keafa halosi agofolo adesi, Yesu imolane uluba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Uluba ofelesia, Eda godolumone maumo, beba gelelu amofea seleba ofelesia, imolanefea baaba ufulu. Eweguba seleba ufulu, <char style="sc">Ewe <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> Kini. </char><verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27-28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.27-28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ais 53.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesu E imolane uluba ofasiamo, fadilo inolo aidamo E aniba imolane uluba ufulu. Nomo inaloaloba, nomo fofonaloaloba uluba ufulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sng 22.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109.25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mag 14.58</ref></char></note>Idele inolo Yesuda imolane uluba ufuluiya amolo, suniaba dedaleba ligiamo, ine guni folalelabia dedaleba ligia, baaba gaidesia, soaneba selesia, “Ha ha! <char style="w">Sebele molo</char> bidifasia, hilia osoloa diyobasuba solu inolo amo, Ga! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Aga Gene meleba gasiba dafogosia, imolane afasia, helea hugama!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" /><char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ilida aubasu baaba gaidesia selesia, “Ehe inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diloso</char>, ene meleba gasiba dafelagoba diyale adefe-eee! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Inolo Gode Iminifia Molobebelelu lago Ga, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> kini lago Ga, imolane afasia, nini si bafasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesine</char>, huga mila-aaa!” Ili auba selesi, fadilo inolo aida, E aniba imolane uluba ufulu amoda, aubasu nagamesi kanoba ofa selaba alolu.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu olalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Madiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lugu 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yone 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Halo dogo adesi, helefealu nigiligagalu gasiagufia ligiasu, halosi osoloa alolu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sng 22.1</ref></char></note>Halosi osolo adesi, Yesu koleba wuaasia, eweguba solu. “<char style="sls">Eloi, Eloi, lama sabagadani?</char>” Sulu amo eweguba besife. “<char style="qt">Ne Gode, Ne Gode, Mau enene, Na hafinimesi, Ga Na faiso mese?</char>” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Idele inolo imolane aniba alebailumo, sulu amo dofasia selesia, “Doma, E Elaiya wefebu.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sng 69.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, inolo uleno naguba daafia, fagulo gelelu uleno difasia, kaiamesi waini hano besegililu gefia, i aafo dofafia, inigia, Yesufea sunimesi mesia, selesia, “Aso baaba mela. Elaiya milifasia, E sububa dafogofelaba babiyone.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Aufia, Yesu koleba galagilifia, hame suluba dafulu.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ausi, fagulo sebele moloa ami goloba helelumo, anafia sunia aidaba sosoaba helea asuba dafogolu. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Yobolone yasilo Yesu aniba kalugaafia alolu amohe, E olafemone bafasia, eweguba solu. “Lago seale Godene faibe kolebabu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lug 8.2-3</ref></char></note>Auba labi, idele noolo wedino hago ligia, sidafia alebailu. Idele ili aleba ami alolumo, ido nomo, hele Magadala ido, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Malia</char>. Aufia, enesaiyo nomo, Yemesedenodai, Yosesedai, aine enaemo, Malia. Ido nomo, Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Yesu Galili helea ami aso siba labimo, idele ili eweda E kuliba siba ligia, E sagoba ofolabia silo. Idele wedinale nooloda, Yesu Yelusalame saabi fogomo, Edai mulumoda ami alolu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune domala abane dana usu baliba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Madiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Lugu 23.50-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yone 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Geidesi, Alimadia inolo <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[4]], Alimadia dauno inolo alolu ">Yosebe</char> mulu. E Yuda mosomune galisolo asigida dulu, uleno e alolu. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada miliyobafemo holobagaeyobafefia yasiba asulu. Aidemo, Sabada hilia holobagaeyobafegulu, agayagi amone madeneyoba. Aulugulu geidesi, e sagilibale <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea daafia, Yesune domalamo diyone doba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Filadusu e Yesu ama olaluba selefemo hidigiba dobelesiamo, ibolo selu inolofea seale olalulaba bea malalu. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ibolo selu inolohe Yesu seale olaluba selesi, Filadusu e Yosebefea “Yesune domala waagi dia malaba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Aufia, Yosebe e fagulo hoolu elegea daafia, Yesune domala sububa difasia, fagulo amo masofia, digidibia abia, abane usu inolo baliyone nageleiya ami ufulu. Ofasia, Yosebehe abane no bebelolabia abia, abane nagelelu enomo kaaba dafulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Ausi, Magadala ido <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Maliada</char>, Yosesene enae Maliada, aaluhe Yesune domala ami baliba ofelefemo abulu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu haiba degelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Madiyu 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lugu 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yone 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Sabada hilia">Sabada hiliamo</char> elosi, Magadala ido <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Maliada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesene</char> enae Maliada, aufia Salomeda, ili Yesune domala heeyone walea hano kasineda nafulu elegelu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Sabada hilia amone faisa, hilia agele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane sogo alegalu hilia agelemo, nini hilia Domoba sodo. Aulune, Yesu hilia Domo haiba degelu. Aulugulu, nini hilia Domo guluguluba ado.</char></note> adesi, keafale koleba, halo holobagasi, ili amo Yesu baliba ufuluiya daalu. Ami goayone nenelabia inigiamo, selesia, <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />“Abane eno kaalumo, abehe nini sagoba bebeloyobafebiba” selabia milibailu.<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ili ami goasia, bosolufalumo, abane hagolu bule balilu eno kaalumo, bebeloba daalu dobi abulu. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ili dana usu suga dedalesia, bosolufalumo, inolo faibe fisamili, fagulo hoolu selale kaalu, sone inaloafealo ami yoba saabi baafia, ili hidigisia momoleba abulu. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Inolo amo selesia, “Gili hidigimabu. Gili Nasalede Yesu <char style="w">imolane</char> olalumone domala ufulumo babiyone muluso, E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefia</char> daalu. E iwi male. Ene domala ufuluiya ewe, gili bama. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mad 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mag 14.28</ref></char></note>Aga gili obegeba daafia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifeada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidafeada</char>, eweguba saeyo malale. ‘Yesu Edale Galili helea saminiba maiyone aafegulu, gilida ami dedalemale. Samini E gilifea saaba meluguba, ami wakaliyobafeba’ ilifea saamaleba” solu. <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Aufia, idele ili hidigifia bibililabia, momolelabia, abane nagelelu usu alolumo holobagafia, fisaba dedalelu. Ili sagilisia, ulenofeada sulu soluale.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magadala ido Maliahe Yesu abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu haiba degelumo, Sabada hilia amone faisa, hilia agele, keafa nigilibale ami degelu. Degefasia, E-mo Magadala ido <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Malia</char> e labeadale holobagalu. Ido amo, samini <char style="w">gamodo</char> domoba felalugulu, Yesuhe gamodo amo efea alolumo asigaba dafulubiyo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Yesu e labea holobagasi bafasia, Malia abia, Yesuda kuliba silo ili kuanosia yegiliba alebaibia ami goafia, ehe ilifea saaba melu. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Auluso, ili dobelesia, Yesu E bebea alefasia labi, Malia abulumeba selefe amofea, ili asigi ule ufuluale.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelu faibe aidamo eno aiba daaba labi, Yesu holobagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lugu 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Dufia, walelu faibe aidamo, Yelusalame afasia, eno aiba daaba labi, Yesu misi nokene dedegefia, aalu aafea ami holobagalu. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Aufasia, aalu obegeba daafia, ili noolomofea awaba meluso, ili sealeba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char>.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe walelu faibilifea molomesine saaba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Madiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lugu 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yone 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:5">1Kld 15.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dufia, walelu faibili kileleba ili naiyo naba labi, Yesu E ami holobagalu. Auba holobagafia labi, Ehe ilifea gadiba solu. Maumo, ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char> alolubiyo. Noolohe ilifea selesia, “Nini Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefia</char> labi abuluba” solumo, ilihe auba solumo sealeba sigidubiyo hamelualebiyo. Aulune, Yesuhe ilifea gadiba solu.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:8">HD 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gili helefealu sunia dedaleba yaafia, Godene Awalu Sulu Nafulu idele inolo suniafea waleyo malale. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">HD 2.38</ref></char></note>Sunia abehe asigi ule ofelesi, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gesenaga</char>, amo Godehe ili gasiba dafelagoyobafe. Auluso, idele inolo asigi ule ofelesalenaga, fadaasia osolaba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">HD 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:7">8.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> ewemo, asigi uleda ofelefe ili alebaibia ami, holobagaeyobafe. Ne wi saabia alefasia, ilihe <char style="w">gamodo</char> asigaba dafaliyobafe. Aufia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> saeyobafe. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:19">Lug 10.19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:3-6">HD 28.3-6</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe soiye aiyane sone seyobafe. Ilihe inoloda dufa olalo hano naasenaga, ili woba ufiyobafale. Ine sonehe walefalu inolo gesi, ili waiyobafe.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Hebene daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lugu 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Hilibaisi Daalu 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">HD 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:33-34">2.33-34</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu ilifea saaba samodofia, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w">Hebene</char> ana diba lagolu. Diba lagofasia, E Godene sone ililibefealo ami yoba asulu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:3">HD 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:3-4">Hib 2.3-4</ref></char></note>Ausi, walelu faibili ili helefealu sunia dedalefia, awalu sulu walelabia silu. Auba walelabia sisimo, Saminilohe ili sagoba ofelesia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> noekene holobagagamesi moloba ufulu. Ausiamo, Ehe Ene sulu amo kiwigaaba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:20">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="End of Book OnobasuluNarrativeGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="16.20" /><verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>